Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.60,0:01:01.66, ,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,80)}{\fn宋体\fs14\an5\pos(193,165)\bord0.3\c&H978052\3c&H978052}少   数   派   报   告{\fad(80,900)}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.14,0:01:36.55, ,,0,0,0,,- 你知道没有了他们我会多么迷茫吗? - 别哭 霍华德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You know how blind I am without them. - Howard don't cry.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.62,0:02:01.04, ,,0,0,0,,谋杀!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Murder!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.36,0:02:25.36, ,,0,0,0,,[受害者] 撒拉·马克思 唐纳·杜宾
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.28,0:02:36.28, ,,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运 约翰 - 身体不舒服吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Good luck, John. - Any contractions?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.32,0:02:38.07, ,,0,0,0,,只有你给我的那一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Only the ones you give me.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.16,0:02:41.21, ,,0,0,0,,2054年
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.93,0:02:51.93, ,,0,0,0,,[凶犯] 霍华德·马克思
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.42,0:02:57.22, ,,0,0,0,,- 好的 杰德 什么情况? - 红球...双重杀人事件 被害人一男一女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Okay, Jad, what's coming? - Red ball...double homicide, one male, one female.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.26,0:02:59.34, ,,0,0,0,,凶手是男性 白人 40岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Killer's male, white, 40's.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.39,0:03:02.01, ,,0,0,0,,影像时间在早上8:04\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Aggregated the time frame at 8:04 a.m.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.06,0:03:04.68, ,,0,0,0,,影像有些模糊 所以地点还没有确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The twins are a little fuzzy on that, so we need a confirmation.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.77,0:03:07.98, ,,0,0,0,,凶案地点仍未查出 鉴定人已联接入系统...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Location still uncertain. Remote witnesses are plugged in...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.19,0:03:10.52, ,,0,0,0,,这被立为第1108号案件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This will be case #1108.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.03,0:03:23.99, ,,0,0,0,,1108号案件 根据预测师影像 指控未来杀人罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Case #1108, previsualized by the Precogs and recorded on holosphere by Precrime's q-stacks.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.04,0:03:28.46, ,,0,0,0,,1108案鉴定人 金凯瑟琳博士和波拉德法官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}My fellow witnesses for case #1108 are Dr. Katherine James and Chief Justice Frank Pollard.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.54,0:03:29.92, ,,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 早上好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Good morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.96,0:03:33.46, ,,0,0,0,,鉴定人 审查1108号案的工作 现在可以开始吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Will the witnesses preview and validate #1108 at this time?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.51,0:03:36.55, ,,0,0,0,,- 批准 - 开始吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Affirmative I will validate. - Go get him.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.18,0:03:38.88, ,,0,0,0,,遵命...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Stand by...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.93,0:03:42.93, ,,0,0,0,,谋杀发生时间为早上8:04 离现在还有44分30秒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Time of murder: 08:04 a.m. That is 44 minutes 30 seconds from now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.00,0:03:44.00, ,,0,0,0,, 这是红球(凶杀案件)\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is a red ball.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.17,0:04:17.38, ,,0,0,0,,霍华德·马克思 你究竟在哪里?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Alright, Howard Marks, where are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.59,0:04:21.34, ,,0,0,0,,霍华德 吃早餐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Howard! Howard, breakfast!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.15,0:04:39.74, ,,0,0,0,,87年前...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Four score and seven years ago...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.49,0:04:41.53, ,,0,0,0,,他有点脸熟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He looked familiar.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.07,0:04:45.99, ,,0,0,0,,- 谁? - 那个站在街对面公园的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Who? - The man standing in the park across the street.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.16,0:04:47.99, ,,0,0,0,,我以前见过他 \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I have seen him before. 
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.21, ,,0,0,0,,你没戴眼镜怎么认得? 你知道你有多近视\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10} How can you even tell, you know how blind you are without your glasses.

Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.04, ,,0,0,0,,- 你的眼镜放哪了? - 可能放在卧室里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Where are your glasses? - I must have left them up in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.17,0:04:55.17, ,,0,0,0,,你快就要迟到了...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're running out of time...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.46,0:04:56.63, ,,0,0,0,,你知道我有多迷茫...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You know how blind I am...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.73,0:05:14.85, ,,0,0,0,,我在辖区内查到八个"霍华德·马克思" 年龄 人种都符合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I show eight "Howard Marks" in the District. Sorted by race and age.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.77,0:05:19.65, ,,0,0,0,,去找执照登记 看看能有什么线索\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Run the licence and registration. See if we can capture him this way.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.49,0:05:29.20, ,,0,0,0,,你能办得到吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can you grab that?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.91,0:05:30.50, ,,0,0,0,,还不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's unclear.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.29,0:05:35.79, ,,0,0,0,,- 我有六张符合要求的执照 你认为是哪个? - 就在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I got six licences what do you want? - Over here, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.07,0:06:07.95, ,,0,0,0,,他们在金斯保罗区福克斯路4221号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Got him in the Foxhall. 4421 Gainsborough.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.28,0:06:11.45, ,,0,0,0,,派一个行动组过去 在河边设置警戒线\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Send a DCPD blue & white. Set up a perimeter of the river.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.62,0:06:14.41, ,,0,0,0,,我在想今天我或许 可以不去上班 在家里呆着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You know I was thinking maybe I'd play hooky. Stay home today.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.08,0:06:18.04, ,,0,0,0,,我们可以去郊游...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We have come to dedicate a portion of that field...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.59,0:06:19.29, ,,0,0,0,,你觉的怎么样?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What do you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.46,0:06:21.38, ,,0,0,0,,好好的休息一下... 那你的会议怎么办?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Become a resting place...what about your meeting?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.55,0:06:24.63, ,,0,0,0,,我会改期 最近一直都在忙着工作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'll reschedule. I've been working too much anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.60,0:06:29.68, ,,0,0,0,,我们可以共进午餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We can have lunch together.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.68,0:06:34.31, ,,0,0,0,,我也想...我也很想这样 但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I would love...I would love to.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.90,0:06:38.23, ,,0,0,0,,我还要打扫房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I have an opening house like the rest of the place
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.57,0:06:44.99, ,,0,0,0,,我想这就是你看起来如此可爱的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I guess that's why you look so nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.78,0:06:51.49, ,,0,0,0,,长官! 我们对于案发地点的定位有麻烦了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Chief! We got a problem with our location.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.54, ,,0,0,0,,- 他们已经不住那了 - 见鬼!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It's no longer there. - Shit!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.38,0:07:00.04, ,,0,0,0,,- 还有多少时间? - 30分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Time frame? - 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.19,0:07:02.25, ,,0,0,0,,约翰 调查局的朋友来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10} Chief, the investigator from the Fed is here.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.71, ,,0,0,0,,我现在最需要的就是 那些调查局的饭桶离我远点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All I need is some twink from the Fed poking around right now.

Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.76,0:07:06.80, ,,0,0,0,,约翰 信息传到了你的电脑里 我也给你家留了信息...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John, the word is on your counter, I left your message at your house...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.84,0:07:08.20, ,,0,0,0,,再查一下那片纸上的内容 他们已经搬走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Check again with the paper, they had it forwarded. 
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.24,0:07:10.14, ,,0,0,0,,问问他们的邻居是否知道他们去哪了 还有他们的亲戚...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}See if the neighbors know where they went, check all relations...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.18,0:07:11.14, ,,0,0,0,,查一下他们所有的亲戚邻居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Checking neighbors and their relations...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.18,0:07:13.60, ,,0,0,0,,- 但是约翰... - 给他一杯咖啡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- But John... - Fletch just get him some coffee.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.64,0:07:16.10, ,,0,0,0,,给他讲讲我们每天如何保全人们性命的事 还有你如何离不开我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Tell him some stories how I save your ass everyday, and you can't live without me.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.14,0:07:17.35, ,,0,0,0,,我已经有咖啡了 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I got coffee, thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.81,0:07:19.61, ,,0,0,0,,丹尼·维特沃 "调查局的饭桶" \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Danny Witwer. The "Twink from the Fed".
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.21,0:07:22.01, ,,0,0,0,, 哦喔 要口香糖吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Woops. Gum?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.90,0:07:25.19, ,,0,0,0,,对不起 丹尼 但我现在没时间陪你四处去转\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sorry Danny, but I'll have to give you the full tour some other time.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.24,0:07:26.30, ,,0,0,0,,马克斯一家两个星期前搬走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The Marks have moved two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.40,0:07:29.36, ,,0,0,0,,没有人知道他们去了哪 仍然在调查他的家人和雇主\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Nobody knows where. Still searching for family and employer.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.41,0:07:31.07, ,,0,0,0,,还剩12分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Time horizon: 12 minutes...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.45,0:07:33.20, ,,0,0,0,,我们管他正在做的事叫重组影像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What he's doing now, we call "scrubbing the image", 
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.25,0:07:35.50, ,,0,0,0,,找寻即将发生的谋杀案地点的线索\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}looking for clues as to where the murder's going to happen.

Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.12,0:07:38.83, ,,0,0,0,,砖墙的堆砌有佐治亚风格...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Original running bond brick pattern, streamlined early Georgian Details...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.00, ,,0,0,0,,砖墙被重漆过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The brick has been repainted.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.38,0:07:44.13, ,,0,0,0,,- 这个国家 - 这个国家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- And that this nation. - And that this nation.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.17,0:07:45.30, ,,0,0,0,,- 在上帝的保佑下 - 在上帝的保佑下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Under God. - Under God.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.34,0:07:47.05, ,,0,0,0,,- 决不会从地球上消失 - 决不会从地球上...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Shall not perish from the earth. - Shall not perish from the...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.64, ,,0,0,0,,受害者的名字从这里出来 而凶手的名字在这边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Victims are pronounced here. Killers here.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.00,0:07:51.51, ,,0,0,0,,除了这些 还有犯罪发生的时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Beyond that, the date of the crime,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.70,0:07:54.01, ,,0,0,0,,我们就只能分析他们生成的图像获得线索了 \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}all we have to run on are the images, that they produce.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.19,0:08:07.65, ,,0,0,0,,- 一个警察骑在马背上 - 靠近首都?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I show a cop on horseback. - Near the capital?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.15,0:08:10.07, ,,0,0,0,,- 没有磁悬浮系统 - 林荫道?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- No maglev system. - The mall?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.83,0:08:12.70, ,,0,0,0,,佐治镇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Georgetown.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.28,0:08:16.25, ,,0,0,0,,预言者可以提前四天就知道凶手? 那叫什么来着?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The Precogs can see a murder four days out. What are that liked called?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.29,0:08:17.45, ,,0,0,0,,嗯 我们叫它红球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Well, we call it the Red Ball.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.75,0:08:20.42, ,,0,0,0,,这些犯罪情绪通常都不是预谋的 所以他们会感知的比较晚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The crimes of passion is no premeditation so they show up late.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.88,0:08:22.92, ,,0,0,0,,大多数案件是类似现在这样瞬间发生的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Most of our scrambles are flash events like this one.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.25,0:08:25.21, ,,0,0,0,,现在很少见到预谋杀人了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We rarely see anything with premeditation anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.55,0:08:26.71, ,,0,0,0,,人们已经明白这个意思了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}People have gotten the message.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.88,0:08:28.88, ,,0,0,0,,哦 这太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh this is good.

Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.34,0:08:32.00, ,,0,0,0,,我找到了一个匹配是德文特·金斯利 十八世纪建筑师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I show a match a for Dwight Kingsley. Eighteen century architect.

Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.14,0:08:33.72, ,,0,0,0,,他在华盛顿建了十几栋这样的房子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He did two dozen houses in D.C.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.34,0:08:33.72, ,,0,0,0,,


Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.76,0:08:35.10, ,,0,0,0,,剩余10分钟...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Time horizon, ten minutes...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.14, ,,0,0,0,,十分钟!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Ten minutes!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.27,0:08:42.90, ,,0,0,0,,看这个孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Look at this kid.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.19, ,,0,0,0,,在这个影像里他在穿西服的男人左边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In this one, he's on the left of the man in the suit.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.86, ,,0,0,0,,- 是的 那又怎么样? - 在这个影像里他变成在右边了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Yes, so? - This one he is on the right.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.13,0:09:09.21, ,,0,0,0,,转转椅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Merry-go-round.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.55,0:09:11.47, ,,0,0,0,,那是个公园\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's a park.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.51,0:09:18.06, ,,0,0,0,,本市这样的老式转转椅的公园 只有十六个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There's only sixteen of those old merry-go-rounds left in the city.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.93,0:09:21.31, ,,0,0,0,,佐治镇有两个 一个在巴纳比森林 另一个在维里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Two in Georgetown. One in Barnaby Woods, the others in Woodley.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.35,0:09:24.11, ,,0,0,0,,维里都是维多利亚式建筑 肯定是在巴纳比森林 飞过去要多久?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Woodley's all Victorian. It's gotta be Barnaby Woods.  Evanna flight time?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.25,0:09:26.11, ,,0,0,0,,如果我开的话 三分钟就能到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Three minutes and the wheel's up.

Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.70,0:09:41.50, ,,0,0,0,,- 好了吗? - 好了!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Clear? - Clear!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.54,0:09:42.33, ,,0,0,0,,好了!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Clear!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.27,0:10:03.77, ,,0,0,0,,剩余时间6分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Time horizon: 6 minutes...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.97,0:10:44.44, ,,0,0,0,,- 我们去床上好吗? - 就在这吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Let's go to bed. - Let's do it in here.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.69,0:10:49.31, ,,0,0,0,,- 床比较软 - 我也很软\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- The bed is soft. - I'm soft.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.20,0:11:37.20, ,,0,0,0,,见鬼!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Shit!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.20,0:11:39.99, ,,0,0,0,,到底是哪一个?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Which one is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.92,0:11:58.13, ,,0,0,0,,只剩1分钟了 长官 我们必须采取下一步行动了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Time horizon: 1 minute. Chief, we've catching up to the future.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.26,0:11:59.59, ,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 爱万娜 杰德?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Shut up Evanna. Jad?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.35,0:12:02.39, ,,0,0,0,,- 杰德? - 请讲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Jad? - Go ahead.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.93,0:12:05.56, ,,0,0,0,,- 他关前门了吗? - 什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Did he close the front door? - What?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.02,0:12:07.39, ,,0,0,0,,马克思关前门了吗? !\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Did Marks close the front door?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.41,0:12:31.29, ,,0,0,0,,没有 前门是开着的 前门开着!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Negative. The front door is open! The front door is open!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.50,0:12:32.75, ,,0,0,0,,剩余时间30秒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Time horizon: 30 seconds...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.22,0:12:44.01, ,,0,0,0,,- 我忘了我的眼镜 - 哦 霍华德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I forgot my glasses. - Oh. Howard.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.07,0:12:57.90, ,,0,0,0,,你知道如果失去了他们 我会多么迷茫吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You know how blind I am without them.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.74,0:13:00.90, ,,0,0,0,,霍华德 别哭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Howard don't cry.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.87,0:13:02.53, ,,0,0,0,,马克思!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Marks!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.22,0:13:23.59, ,,0,0,0,,看着我 看着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.81,0:13:30.14, ,,0,0,0,,确认是霍华德·马克思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Positive for Howard Marks.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.10,0:13:31.81, ,,0,0,0,,马克思先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Mr. Marks.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.27,0:13:34.56, ,,0,0,0,,遵照哥伦比亚特区犯罪预防部门的命令\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}By mandate of the District of Columbia Precrime division, -
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.27,0:13:38.03, ,,0,0,0,,我们以即将谋杀撒拉·马克思 和唐纳德·杜宾的罪名逮捕你...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I'm placing you under arrest for the future murder of Sarah Marks and Donald Doobin, -
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.07,0:13:42.07, ,,0,0,0,,该凶杀案本应在今天 4月22日 8点零4分发生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- that was to take place today, April 22, at zero-eight hundred hours, four minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.11,0:13:44.70, ,,0,0,0,,不 我什么也没有做 撒拉!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No. I didn't do anything. Sarah!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.82,0:13:45.78, ,,0,0,0,,给这位先生戴上帽子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Give the man his hat.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.83,0:13:49.45, ,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 别把那个环套在我头上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, God. Don't put the halo on me!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.21,0:13:51.96, ,,0,0,0,,- 撒拉! - 手放到头上!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Sarah! - Put your hand on your head!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.00,0:13:55.33, ,,0,0,0,,救救我! 我没打算干什么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Help me! I wasn't gonna do anything!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.09,0:14:00.76, ,,0,0,0,,为什么你不稍微安静几分钟听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why don't you just sit here a minut a listen to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.17,0:14:04.22, ,,0,0,0,,你的丈夫已被预防罪案部逮捕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Your husband has been arrested by officers from Precrime.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.59,0:14:05.84, ,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 霍华德! 不!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, God Howard! No!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.06, ,,0,0,0,,霍华德 别哭!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Howard, don't cry!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.85,0:14:10.77, ,,0,0,0,,霍华德 别哭!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Howard, don't cry!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.56,0:14:15.52, ,,0,0,0,,霍华德 别哭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Howard, please don't cry!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.81,0:14:18.48, ,,0,0,0,,哦 天那 哦 天那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, God! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.03,0:14:23.11, ,,0,0,0,,我想他们阻止了谋杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I thought they stopped the murder.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.95,0:14:25.91, ,,0,0,0,,那只是重复的回想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That's just an echo.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.45,0:14:28.41, ,,0,0,0,,一种预言师的记忆幻觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}A Precog deja vu, if you will.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.29,0:14:31.79, ,,0,0,0,,糟糕的是他们总是 一次又一次看见犯罪场景\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The really bad ones, the Precogs see over and over again.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.54,0:14:34.21, ,,0,0,0,,瓦利 切断传输\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wally. Erase the incoming.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.64,0:14:51.64, ,,0,0,0,,想像一个没有谋杀的世界\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Imagine a world without murder.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.56,0:14:54.94, ,,0,0,0,,我失去了我最好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I lost my best friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.98,0:14:56.27, ,,0,0,0,,- 我失去了我的姨妈 - 我失去了爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I lost my aunt. - I lost my dad.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.31,0:14:57.85, ,,0,0,0,,- 我失去了我父亲 - 我失去了我妻子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I lost my father. - I lost my wife.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.15,0:15:02.36, ,,0,0,0,,就在六年前这个国家的谋杀案 达到前所未有的高峰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just six years ago the homicide rate in this country had reached epidemic proportions.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.99,0:15:05.74, ,,0,0,0,,看来只有奇迹才能阻止这些凶杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It seemed that only a miracle could stop the bloodshed.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.03,0:15:10.33, ,,0,0,0,,但我们得到了不止一个奇迹 而是三个 我们的犯罪预言师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But instead of one miracle we were given three. The precognitives.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.12, ,,0,0,0,,仅仅在预防罪案计划 开始实施的一个月内\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Within just one month under the Precrime programme.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.58,0:15:17.08, ,,0,0,0,,哥伦比亚特区的凶杀案 就大幅下降90％\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The murder rate in the District of Columbia was reduced 90 percent.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.33,0:15:18.79, ,,0,0,0,,他们可能已经在车里等着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They were gonna be waiting for me in the car.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.84,0:15:19.67, ,,0,0,0,,他可能会强奸我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He was gonna rape me.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.84,0:15:21.29, ,,0,0,0,,- 我本来应该被刺穿了 - 就在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I was gonna be stabbed. - Right here.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.34,0:15:22.21, ,,0,0,0,,一年之内\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Within a year.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.51,0:15:25.80, ,,0,0,0,,预防罪案部在我们首都 有效地制止了凶杀案的发生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Precrime has affectively stopped murder in our nation's capital.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.43,0:15:29.35, ,,0,0,0,,这六年来 我们一直在进行我们的试验\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In the six years we have been conducting out little experiment.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.14,0:15:32.22, ,,0,0,0,,再没有发生一起谋杀案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There hasn't been a single murder.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.27,0:15:34.64, ,,0,0,0,,现在犯罪预防部在为你们工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And now Precrime can work for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.98,0:15:41.06, ,,0,0,0,,他们要确保每一个美国人 都在这个系统的有效保护之下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We want to make absolutely certain that every American can bank of the utter availability of the system.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.40,0:15:45.74, ,,0,0,0,,不仅保证我们的安全 也保证我们的自由\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And to make sure that not only keeps us safe... but also keep us free.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.11,0:15:50.16, ,,0,0,0,,- 预防犯罪部 非常有效! - 非常有效!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Precrime: It works! - It works!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.41,0:15:51.78, ,,0,0,0,,- 有效! - 有效!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It works! - It works!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.83,0:15:53.66, ,,0,0,0,,- 有效! - 有效!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It works! - It works!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.12,0:15:56.91, ,,0,0,0,,预防犯罪部 非常有效!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Precrime: It works!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.96,0:16:01.21, ,,0,0,0,,请在4月22日 星期二 投票支持预防犯罪部\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}On Tuesday April 22, vote Yes on the National Precrime Initiative.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.92,0:16:07.17, ,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 睡不着吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What's the matter, can't sleep?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.39,0:16:14.89, ,,0,0,0,,我只是需要一些货\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I just need a little clarity.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.98,0:16:21.36, ,,0,0,0,,当然 你想要平常的那种还是新改良型的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}True that. You want the customary clarity, or the new and improved kind of clarity?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.19,0:16:22.98, ,,0,0,0,,给我些新货\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just give me the new stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.29,0:16:36.83, ,,0,0,0,,祝你好梦 长官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sweet dreams, Chief.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.08,0:16:44.67, ,,0,0,0,,不必担心 我会为你保守秘密的 而且从中我也可以捞到好处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Don't worry none, your secret's safe with me. Besides I could use little juice on my side.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.30,0:16:46.88, ,,0,0,0,,你以为你知道什么 洛克?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What do you think you know, Lycon?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.76,0:16:49.84, ,,0,0,0,,正如我爸爸所说:\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's like my Daddy used to say:
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.01,0:16:53.01, ,,0,0,0,,"在瞎子的国度..."\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"In the land of the blind..." -
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.60,0:16:58.73, ,,0,0,0,,"有一只眼睛就能成为国王"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"The one eyed-man is King".
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.83,0:17:21.58, ,,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm home.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.80,0:17:31.51, ,,0,0,0,,顶灯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Overhead.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.65,0:18:29.32, ,,0,0,0,,墙面荧幕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wallscreen.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.66, ,,0,0,0,,- "肖恩" - "嘿 爸爸"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "Sean!" - "Hi Daddy!"
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.33,0:18:41.37, ,,0,0,0,,"你能教我如何跑的更快吗? "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Can you teach me how to run faster?"
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.41,0:18:45.12, ,,0,0,0,,"因为班上所有的小朋友都跑的比我快"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Because all the kids at my class run faster than me."
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.29,0:18:45.96, ,,0,0,0,,"不"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"No."
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.59,0:18:49.67, ,,0,0,0,,你看 抬起你的膝盖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Look! Keep your knees up!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.59,0:18:52.96, ,,0,0,0,,就像这样 像这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Like that. Like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.26,0:18:56.26, ,,0,0,0,,高一点 就像那样 你是个天生的跑步好手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}High, high. Like that. See you are a natural runner.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.89,0:18:58.05, ,,0,0,0,,"一直跑! "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Gotta keep running!"
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.64,0:19:00.68, ,,0,0,0,,是的 一直跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yeah. Gotta keep running!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.27,0:19:03.22, ,,0,0,0,,一直跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You gotta keep running.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.69,0:19:06.98, ,,0,0,0,,"我将来能和你跑的一样快吗? "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Will I be as fast as you some day?"
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.36, ,,0,0,0,,你将来一定能赢过我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I think you will beat me some day.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.73,0:19:12.57, ,,0,0,0,,你会赢过所有人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I think you will be everyone some day.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.11,0:19:14.15, ,,0,0,0,,"我要走了..."\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"I gotta go..."
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.57,0:19:16.57, ,,0,0,0,,- "再见" - 不 不 等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "Bye." - No, no, wait wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.74,0:19:19.66, ,,0,0,0,,- 你必须吻我一下 - "不亲嘴唇"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You gotta give me a kiss. - "Not on the lips!"
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.16,0:19:22.66, ,,0,0,0,,"只有妈妈才能亲我嘴唇"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Only mummy kisses me on the lips."
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.41,0:19:26.37, ,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.42,0:19:30.09, ,,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 肖恩 - 我爱你 爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "I love you, Sean." - I love you daddy!"
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.08,0:20:08.29, ,,0,0,0,,"你让我想起了那个海滩"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"You reminds me of Roserito Beach."
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.00,0:20:10.75, ,,0,0,0,,"记得吗? "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Remember?"
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.88,0:20:18.80, ,,0,0,0,,我们身上只有20美元 我们去度假 坐在车里 阳光明媚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Yeah...we had 20 dollars, and waited in the van so the sun would shine on our vacation."
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.89,0:20:25.81, ,,0,0,0,,"约翰 约翰 把摄像机关掉"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"John. John. John put the camera down."
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.85,0:20:29.85, ,,0,0,0,,"看 我...我准备睡觉了 这是什么 不"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Look, I'm...I'm all ready for bed...what...what is this? No."
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.81,0:20:33.73, ,,0,0,0,,"把它拿开 该去睡了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Put it away, it's time to put the camera to sleep."
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.03,0:20:36.36, ,,0,0,0,,"该去照顾你的妻子了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"And time to come and take care of your wife."
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.86,0:20:42.03, ,,0,0,0,,"甜心 为什么不放下摄像机"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Sweetie, why don't you put the camera down," -
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.07,0:20:43.83, ,,0,0,0,,"和我一起看雨景吧"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"and come and watch the rain with me."
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.00,0:20:49.58, ,,0,0,0,,"不? 我保证这会是难忘的记忆"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"No? I promise to make it a memorable moment."
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.84,0:20:57.30, ,,0,0,0,,"听着 要么放下摄像机 要么你今晚什么也得不到"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Look. Put the camera down or you are not getting anything tonight."
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.97,0:21:41.30, ,,0,0,0,,一个司法部的家伙 想夺走我们的一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}A gentleman from Justice wants to take all this away from us.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.55, ,,0,0,0,,你知道 一星期以后人们就要投票...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You understand a week from now people are going to vote on -
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.60,0:21:48.27, ,,0,0,0,,决定我们是否能在这里 继续我们的思路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- whether or not what we've been doing down here has been some noble-minded enterprise -
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.77,0:21:51.52, ,,0,0,0,,...或者获得改变 本市治理犯罪的方式的机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- or a chance to change the way this country fights crime.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.56,0:21:52.39, ,,0,0,0,,我明白 先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I understand. Sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.81,0:21:56.48, ,,0,0,0,,约翰 小心丹尼·维特沃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John. Watch this Danny Witwer.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.53,0:21:59.99, ,,0,0,0,,- 司法部派来的观察员 - 是的 我昨天见过他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- The observer from Justice. - Yes, I met him yesterday.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.03,0:22:03.99, ,,0,0,0,,- 你可以让他四处转转 回答他的问题 但要盯住他 - 是的 先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You can let him look around, answer his questions, but watch him. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.49,0:22:07.41, ,,0,0,0,,- 如果有任何问题 第一时间通知我 - 我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- And if there is any problem, make sure we know about it first. - I understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.20,0:22:09.87, ,,0,0,0,,一旦预言师确定了 一名受害者和凶手...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}When the Precogs declare a victim and a killer -
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.91,0:22:11.66, ,,0,0,0,,...他们的名字 被刻在一个木球上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}their name is embedded in grain of wood.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.87,0:22:14.46, ,,0,0,0,,因为每一个都是独特的 无论纹理或形状\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Since each piece is unique, the shape and grain is unique -
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.50,0:22:16.63, ,,0,0,0,,...形状或纹理不可能被伪造\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}the shape and grain is impossible to forge.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.09,0:22:21.13, ,,0,0,0,,- 我确定你也知道犯罪预警 这种方式的法律缺陷 - 又来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I'm sure you all understand the legalistic drawback to precrime methodology. - Here we go again.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.30,0:22:22.97, ,,0,0,0,,你看 我不代表 ACLU(美国公民自由协会) 杰夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Look, I'm not with the ACLU on this, Jeff.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.63,0:22:26.10, ,,0,0,0,,我们不要骗自己了 我们逮捕的只是并未犯法的个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But let's not kid ourselves, we are arresting individuals who're broken no law.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.15,0:22:27.18, ,,0,0,0,,但是他们会犯法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But they will.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.22,0:22:31.68, ,,0,0,0,,罪案本身是注定会发生的 预言师看到未来 他们没有错过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The commission of the crime itself is absolute metaphysics. The Precogs see the future. And they're never wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.81,0:22:33.23, ,,0,0,0,,但是如果我们阻止了 未来就会改变\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But it's not the future if you stop it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.15,0:22:35.44, ,,0,0,0,,这难道不是自相矛盾吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Isn't that a fundamental paradox?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.19,0:22:37.27, ,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.86,0:22:40.49, ,,0,0,0,,你在谈论预知条件 这总是在发生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're talking about predetermination, which happens all the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.82,0:22:46.78, ,,0,0,0,,- 为什么你抓住它? - 因为它要掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Why did you catch that? - Because it was going to fall.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.33,0:22:48.66, ,,0,0,0,,- 你确定? - 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You're certain? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.95,0:22:51.20, ,,0,0,0,,但是它没有掉 你抓住了它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But it didn't fall. You caught it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.25,0:22:56.04, ,,0,0,0,,事实就是你阻止一件事的发生 并不会改变它原本会发生的事实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The fact that you prevented it from happening doesn't change the fact that it was going to happen.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.38,0:22:57.67, ,,0,0,0,,你遇到过错误的例证吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You ever get any false positives?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.00,0:23:01.96, ,,0,0,0,,有人想杀他的妻子或者老板 但他们从来没有付诸实施过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Someone intends to kill his boss or his wife, but they never go through with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.26,0:23:03.63, ,,0,0,0,,预言师怎么区别其中不同呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How do the Precogs tell the difference?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.22,0:23:07.72, ,,0,0,0,,预言师看不到你倾向与干什么 只能看到你将要干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The Precogs don't see what you intend to do, only what you will do.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.14,0:23:10.76, ,,0,0,0,,那为什么他们不能看的到强奸 袭击或者自杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Then why can't they see rapes, or assaults or suicides?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.27,0:23:12.39, ,,0,0,0,,因为谋杀的本性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Because of the nature of murder.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.69,0:23:15.94, ,,0,0,0,,再没有比见到人类被她的同类谋杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"There's nothing more destructive to the metaphysical fabric" -
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.98,0:23:18.94, ,,0,0,0,,更让人精神痛苦的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"that binds us than the untimely murder of one human being by another".
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.57,0:23:20.98, ,,0,0,0,,不知为什么 我不认为那是沃尔特·惠特曼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Somehow, I don't think that was Walt Whitman.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.11,0:23:22.03, ,,0,0,0,,是艾丽思·海因曼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It was Iris Hineman.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.61,0:23:25.61, ,,0,0,0,,她发明了犯罪预警系统 设计了系统的最初界面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She developed the Precogs, designed the system and pioneered the interface.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.32,0:23:30.12, ,,0,0,0,,- 顺便说一句 我很乐意打个招呼 - 和海因曼?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Speaking of interfacing, I'd love to say hello. - To Hineman?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.74,0:23:31.41, ,,0,0,0,,和他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}To them.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.54,0:23:35.04, ,,0,0,0,,上头有命令不允许进入神殿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Cops aren't allowed inside the temple.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.71,0:23:37.79, ,,0,0,0,,真的吗? 你从来都没有进去过?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Really? You're never been inside?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:38.00,0:23:41.59, ,,0,0,0,,我们遵循严格的隔离程序 以防止任何人被误判\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We keep a strict separation so that no one can be accused of tampering.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.67,0:23:43.13, ,,0,0,0,,那我就是第一个进去的人了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So I'll be the first one to go in then?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.01,0:23:47.34, ,,0,0,0,,- 或许你没有在听我说 - 是否授权存在问题?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Maybe you didn't hear me. - If it's a question of authority.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.51,0:23:54.22, ,,0,0,0,,- 没有问题 你没有任何授权 - 我口袋里的许可证说的可不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- There is no question. You don't have any. - I have a warrant in my pocket that says different.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:07.07,0:24:09.91, ,,0,0,0,,- 给我看看 - 当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Show it to me. - Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:15.45,0:24:17.29, ,,0,0,0,,这次对于犯罪预防部及其人员的调查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This investigation of Precrime and it's personnel.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:17.33,0:24:19.12, ,,0,0,0,,直接由美国政府司法部长\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Has been conducted under the direct supervision, -
Dialogue: 1,0:24:19.17,0:24:22.13, ,,0,0,0,,特别许可及监管\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}and express permission from the Attorney General of the United States.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.46,0:24:24.71, ,,0,0,0,,我作为他的代表来这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm here as his representative.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.51,0:24:29.09, ,,0,0,0,,那就意味着... 你的行动将受我监管\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Which means... you're now operating under my supervision.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.89,0:24:35.43, ,,0,0,0,,看来你很困惑 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It seems you've been left out of the loop, John.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:46.82,0:24:48.90, ,,0,0,0,,好了 我们准备好了 走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Alright we are ready. Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:56.04,0:24:57.33, ,,0,0,0,,在这等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Alright there. Hold it.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:57.37,0:24:59.62, ,,0,0,0,,"未许可入内"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Not cleared for access."
Dialogue: 1,0:25:01.54,0:25:04.38, ,,0,0,0,,"识别 约翰·安德顿允许进入"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Ident. John Anderton approved for entry."
Dialogue: 1,0:25:11.18,0:25:12.93, ,,0,0,0,,- 沃利! - 不 不行...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Wally! - No no no no no...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:12.97,0:25:15.97, ,,0,0,0,,没关系 这是丹尼·维特沃 他从司法部来 我们带他了解一下情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's okay. This is Danny Witwer. He's from Justice and we're to give him a run of the farm.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.35,0:25:19.31, ,,0,0,0,,- 我不能碰你 - 别碰他 或这里的任何东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I can't touch you! - Don't touch him, or anything else in here.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:19.35,0:25:20.60, ,,0,0,0,,- 约翰 你不能进这 - 我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- And John, you can't be in here! - I understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:20.90,0:25:22.77, ,,0,0,0,,你只需要回答他的问题 然后我们就会离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just answer his questions and we will get the hell outta here.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:22.94,0:25:25.82, ,,0,0,0,,- 请告诉我... - 嘘! 他们在睡觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Tell me how... - Shhh! They're sleeping.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:25.86,0:25:28.53, ,,0,0,0,,抱歉 能告诉我 这一切都是怎么运作的吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sorry. Tell me how all this works.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:29.78,0:25:32.95, ,,0,0,0,,光子乳液提供给他们 营养和液体介质\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The photon milk acts as both a nutrient supply and a liquid conductor.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:32.99,0:25:34.95, ,,0,0,0,,那可以增强他们接收的图像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It enhances the images that each of them receive.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.70,0:25:38.75, ,,0,0,0,,那个女人的叫阿加沙 那对双胞胎是阿瑟和丹谢尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We call the female Agatha. The twins are Arthur and Dashiell.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.58,0:25:41.41, ,,0,0,0,,我们对他们进行眼部X光断层扫瞄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We scan by way of optical tomography.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:42.63,0:25:45.34, ,,0,0,0,,白光细微脉冲沿着他们的头夹传播\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}White light pinpoints pulse along the entire length of the headgear -
Dialogue: 1,0:25:45.38,0:25:47.67, ,,0,0,0,,并且在被大脑组织吸收了以后 被重新收集整理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}and are re-read after absorption through their brain tissue.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:49.59,0:25:51.30, ,,0,0,0,,换句话说 我们就能看到他们看到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In other words, we see what they see.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:53.89,0:25:57.39, ,,0,0,0,,他们不会感到任何痛苦 我们必须把睡眠剂小心控制在某个水平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They don't feel any pain. We keep their heads pretty well stocked with dopamine and endorphins.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:57.43,0:26:01.27, ,,0,0,0,,否则他们会沉睡不醒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Plus, we maintain careful control over their serotonin levels.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:01.52,0:26:05.69, ,,0,0,0,,他们也不能太清醒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Don't want them to drift off to sleep, but they can't be kept too awake either.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:05.90,0:26:07.73, ,,0,0,0,,你最好别把他们当成人类看待\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's better if you don'nt think of them as human.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.99,0:26:12.03, ,,0,0,0,,不...比之更甚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No... they're much more than that.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.33,0:26:17.20, ,,0,0,0,,科学已经带走了我们大部分的奇迹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Science has stolen most of our miracles.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:20.16,0:26:23.87, ,,0,0,0,,在某种意义上说他们给我们希望... 希望神力的存在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In a way they give us hope... hope of the existence of the divine.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:24.33,0:26:27.21, ,,0,0,0,,我觉得有趣的是 有人把预测师奉若神明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I find it interesting that some people have begun to deify the Precogs.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:28.30,0:26:30.46, ,,0,0,0,,预测师只是经过 模式筛选之后的产物 仅此而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The Precogs are pattern recognition filters, that's all.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:30.51,0:26:33.01, ,,0,0,0,,- 是的 但是你称这里为"神殿" - 只是一个绰号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Yeah. But you call this room "the temple". - Just a nickname.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:33.97,0:26:37.89, ,,0,0,0,,神谕就是所有的力量 神力总是来源与牧师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The oracle isn't where the power is anyway. The power's always been with the priests.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:38.06,0:26:39.60, ,,0,0,0,,即使他们不得不创造神谕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Even if they had to invent the oracle.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:42.48,0:26:44.90, ,,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙点头 就好像你们知道他在说什么似的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You guys are nodding like you actually know what the hell he's talking about.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.77,0:26:49.15, ,,0,0,0,,好吧 长官 我看 我们这些改变命运的行为...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Well. come on, Chief, the way we were changing destiny and all -
Dialogue: 1,0:26:49.19,0:26:51.94, ,,0,0,0,,我的意思是... 我们不像执法者倒更像僧侣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I mean... we're more like clergy than cops.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:52.65,0:26:54.07, ,,0,0,0,,- 杰德? - 什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Jad? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:54.41,0:26:56.91, ,,0,0,0,,回去工作 所有人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Go to work. All of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:06.00,0:27:08.13, ,,0,0,0,,对不起 老毛病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sorry. Old habit.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:09.05,0:27:11.26, ,,0,0,0,,我在没当警察前 在富勒神学院学习过三年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I spent three years at Fuller Seminary before I became a cop.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:12.05,0:27:15.59, ,,0,0,0,,- 我的父亲非常自豪 - 他对你的择职思路怎么看?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- My father was very proud. - What does he think of your chosen line of work?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:15.68,0:27:19.35, ,,0,0,0,,我不知道 他在我十五岁时 在去都柏林我们的教堂的路上被枪杀了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't know. He was shot and killed when I was fifteen on the steps of our church in Dublin.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:20.60,0:27:22.35, ,,0,0,0,,我知道失去自己最亲近的人 是怎样的感觉 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I know what it's like to lose someone close, John.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:23.48,0:27:25.10, ,,0,0,0,,当然 没有什么能像 失去自己的孩子那样痛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Of course, nothing is like the loss of a child.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:25.65,0:27:28.86, ,,0,0,0,,我没有孩子 所以我只能想像那是什么感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't have any children of my own, so I can only imagine what that must have been like.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:30.40,0:27:33.24, ,,0,0,0,,在众目下自己的独生子被掳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}To lose your son in such a public place like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:34.11,0:27:37.45, ,,0,0,0,,至少现在我们有机会 确保这种事不再发生...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}At least now you and I have the chance to make sure that kind of thing doesn't happen to anyone...
Dialogue: 1,0:27:37.49,0:27:40.53, ,,0,0,0,,为什么你不停止你那虚伪的表演 丹尼 然后告诉我你究竟想找什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why don't you cut the cute act, Danny, and tell me exactly what it is you're looking for?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:40.58,0:27:41.28, ,,0,0,0,,缺陷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Flaws.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:41.70,0:27:44.33, ,,0,0,0,,六年里没有一宗谋杀案 系统没有任何错误 这...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There hasn't been a murder in six years. There's nothing wrong with the system. It is...
Dialogue: 1,0:27:44.37,0:27:45.83, ,,0,0,0,,很完美 我同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Perfect, I agree.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:46.29,0:27:50.63, ,,0,0,0,,如果它有缺陷 他们都是人 他们一直都是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If there's a flaw, it's human. It always is.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:37.05,0:28:37.84, ,,0,0,0,,沃利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wally!
Dialogue: 1,0:28:44.31,0:28:47.10, ,,0,0,0,,你看到了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can you see?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:20.43,0:29:21.34, ,,0,0,0,,约翰 见鬼 出什么事了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John, what the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:22.14,0:29:24.43, ,,0,0,0,,她的肾上腺激素水平已经降到底了! 你对她做了什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Her ACTH levels just shot through the roof! What did you do to her?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:24.47,0:29:25.93, ,,0,0,0,,她突然抓住了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She grabbed me.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:26.02,0:29:28.14, ,,0,0,0,,抓住你? 这不可能 预言师甚至不可能察觉到我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Grabbed you? It's impossible. The Precogs aren't even aware of us.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:28.44,0:29:30.65, ,,0,0,0,,- 在乳液里他们所能看到的只有未来 - 她直直的瞪着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- In the milk all they see is the future. - She looked straight at me.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.48,0:29:34.31, ,,0,0,0,,可能是个恶梦 有时他们会梦见以前的谋杀案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Could have been a nightmare. Sometimes they dream about the old murders.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:34.36,0:29:38.32, ,,0,0,0,,- 她和我说话 - 和你? 她说了什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- She spoke to me. - To you? What did she say?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:39.70,0:29:40.53, ,,0,0,0,,"你看到了吗? "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Can you see?"
Dialogue: 1,0:30:02.05,0:30:02.97, ,,0,0,0,,你是门卫?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You the sentry?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:04.47,0:30:06.31, ,,0,0,0,,是的 先生 我是基德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yes, sir. I'm Gideon.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:07.22,0:30:08.47, ,,0,0,0,,你是安德顿长官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're Chief Anderton.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:09.93,0:30:12.06, ,,0,0,0,,音乐是用来安抚犯人情绪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The music relaxes the prisoners.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:12.94,0:30:16.11, ,,0,0,0,,我从来没见过犯罪预防部的人来过 我没有麻烦吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't ever see any of you precops down here, I'm not in trouble am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:16.78,0:30:19.78, ,,0,0,0,,没有 我只是对一个凶手感兴趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Not yet. I'm interested in a murder.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:19.90,0:30:23.03, ,,0,0,0,,- 我这关了许多 什么类型? - 溺毙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I got plenty of those. Kill type? - Drowning.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:23.66,0:30:26.58, ,,0,0,0,,这种手段很少见 这种凶手不多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That narrows it down. Not too many in here for that one.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.62,0:30:28.16, ,,0,0,0,,受害人是高加索白人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Victim's Caucasian female.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:28.41,0:30:30.12, ,,0,0,0,,有关司法部吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This about the Justice Department?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:30.37,0:30:32.87, ,,0,0,0,,我被告知明天要穿着整齐 接待他们审查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm supposed to spruce up for a tour the got planned for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:33.21,0:30:34.96, ,,0,0,0,,告诉我要打领带 你喜欢这东西吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Told me to wear a tie. You like this one?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:35.04,0:30:35.67, ,,0,0,0,,停!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:39.71,0:30:40.51, ,,0,0,0,,倒回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Roll back.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:42.80,0:30:43.38, ,,0,0,0,,那里!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:44.26,0:30:46.76, ,,0,0,0,,她这个案子可是很早了 最早的案件之一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She's a golden oldie. One of our first.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:47.18,0:30:48.72, ,,0,0,0,,可能是在你来之前就有了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Probably before your time.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:50.27,0:30:53.69, ,,0,0,0,,- 这是三个预测师预测的官方合成记录吗? - 是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- This is the official composite of the three Precogs? - That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:54.73,0:30:57.73, ,,0,0,0,,资料影像全部基于他们三个预测镜象\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Combined data stream based on all three previsions.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:58.02,0:30:59.78, ,,0,0,0,,只显示给我阿加沙的预测镜像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just show me Agatha's data stream.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:00.19,0:31:00.98, ,,0,0,0,,这样啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}For that.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:03.32,0:31:04.53, ,,0,0,0,,我们来趟旅行吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We go for a ride.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:26.89,0:31:27.68, ,,0,0,0,,我的上帝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}My God.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.01,0:31:30.68, ,,0,0,0,,我已经忘了这有这么多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I have forgotten there were so many.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:31.39,0:31:35.06, ,,0,0,0,,你想想 如果没有你们 他们在外面都会杀人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And to think they're all be out there killing people if it wasn't for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:36.69,0:31:39.69, ,,0,0,0,,看看他们 看上去多么平和\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Look at them. Look at how peaceful they all seam.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:39.86,0:31:42.82, ,,0,0,0,,但是内心却狂躁不安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But on the inside: Busy, busy, busy.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:43.95,0:31:48.03, ,,0,0,0,,哦 这个 这是个坏蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Okee pokee. Now that is one bad man.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:48.74,0:31:51.83, ,,0,0,0,,他把一个叫安妮·莱夫利的女人 淹死在罗兰湖里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He drowned a woman named Anne Lively out at Roland Lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:52.37,0:31:55.12, ,,0,0,0,,凶手是个无名氏 没有身份识别\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The killer is a John Doe. Never identified.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:11.51,0:32:15.68, ,,0,0,0,,为什么他的身份不能确定? 不能进行眼部扫瞄辨认吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why is he still a John Doe? Why wasn'nt he ever ID's from the EYEscan?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:15.81,0:32:17.35, ,,0,0,0,,问题在于那不是他的眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}On account of those are not his eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:17.85,0:32:20.15, ,,0,0,0,,他换了眼睛想蒙骗识别器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He had them swapped out to fool the scanners.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:20.82,0:32:23.98, ,,0,0,0,,现在街上花几千块就能办到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You get it done on the street for a few thousand bucks these days.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:24.86,0:32:29.70, ,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 那么你只想要 那个女人看到的影像 - 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Okay, so you want just the female prevision. - That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:36.62,0:32:41.54, ,,0,0,0,,- 我们看来没有她的镜像 - 再试试\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- We don't seem to have her data. - Try again.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:43.96,0:32:44.88, ,,0,0,0,,真是奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is odd.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:46.26,0:32:49.14, ,,0,0,0,,你看 我们有两个预知镜像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}See. We have the two previsions.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:49.59,0:32:52.05, ,,0,0,0,,阿瑟的和丹谢尔的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We got what Art saw, we got what Dash saw.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:52.72,0:32:54.81, ,,0,0,0,,但是阿加沙的不在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But Agatha's isn't here.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:58.23,0:32:59.44, ,,0,0,0,,可能只是个小故障\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Probably just a glitch.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:59.77,0:33:02.06, ,,0,0,0,,告诉我有关受害人的事 那个安妮·莱夫利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Tell me about the intended victim. This Anne Lively.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:04.53,0:33:07.94, ,,0,0,0,,看起来她是个瘾君子 就像那个无名氏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Looks like she was a neuroin addict like our John Doe here, -
Dialogue: 1,0:33:08.40,0:33:11.37, ,,0,0,0,,但是我这有条历史记录 显示她的戒毒所地址\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- but I show an address history that includes the Beaton Clinic.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:11.87,0:33:13.95, ,,0,0,0,,那就是说她戒毒了 那她现在在哪?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So she cleaned up. Where is she now?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:16.50,0:33:18.41, ,,0,0,0,,我猜又出故障了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I guess glitches come in two's.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:20.88,0:33:24.63, ,,0,0,0,,你会发觉从一个洞里面爬出来 又掉进了另外一个洞里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You finally crawl your way out of one hole, just to fall into another.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:31.18,0:33:35.47, ,,0,0,0,,不 我不能让你把资料带出去 长官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No. I can't let you take that out of here, Chief.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:37.73,0:33:40.73, ,,0,0,0,,- 这是违反规定的 - 这里还有其他什么事违反规定吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It's against the rules. - Anything else going on in here that's against the rules?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:47.19,0:33:48.07, ,,0,0,0,,小心点 长官...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Careful, Chief...
Dialogue: 1,0:33:48.74,0:33:52.28, ,,0,0,0,,你翻旧帐 只会发现它们肮脏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You dig up the past, all you get is dirty.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:57.50,0:34:01.46, ,,0,0,0,,你说第三个镜像怎么了 类似模糊或者什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And you say the third prevision was, what, kind of fuzzy or something?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:01.50,0:34:04.88, ,,0,0,0,,不 是没有第三个镜像 阿加沙的镜像不在里面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No, no the third prevision, Agatha's prevision, wasn't there.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:05.71,0:34:06.90, ,,0,0,0,,还不仅如此 我在那里多花了点时间查了一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That's not all. I spent a few hours down there
Dialogue: 1,0:34:07.01,0:34:09.76, ,,0,0,0,,发现有十几个案件的镜像都不完全\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}and there's a dozen more cases with missing previsions.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:11.72,0:34:15.39, ,,0,0,0,,- 我还以为我们找到治疗感冒的方法了呢 - 该吃药了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You're think we're have found a cure for the common cold by now. - It's stress.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:15.85,0:34:18.22, ,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么? - 加蜂蜜的草药茶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- What's this? - Herbal tea with honey.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:19.85,0:34:22.64, ,,0,0,0,,我讨厌草药茶...也讨厌蜂蜜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I hate herbal tea...almost as much as I hate honey.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:23.15,0:34:25.23, ,,0,0,0,,在我把它倒在你大腿上之前 你最好喝了它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just drink it before I pour it in your lap.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:26.15,0:34:27.27, ,,0,0,0,,- 你需要点什么吗 约翰? - 不 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Can I get you anything, John? - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:29.03,0:34:33.24, ,,0,0,0,,维沃特计划明天去监守室查看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Witwer is scheduled for a Containment... tour of Containment tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.28,0:34:34.49, ,,0,0,0,,好啊 带他去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yeah, give him a tour.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:36.45,0:34:38.45, ,,0,0,0,,- 劳拉打了电话给我 - 什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Lara called me. - What?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:39.41,0:34:44.58, ,,0,0,0,,- 她很担心你 坦白的说 我也是 - 我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- She's worried about you. And, quite frankly, so am I. - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:45.38,0:34:47.79, ,,0,0,0,,我明白你把大部分时间放在工作上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I understand you're been spending a lot of time in the sprawl.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:50.47,0:34:53.18, ,,0,0,0,,- 我去过那里 - 在午夜?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I go running down there. - In the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:54.01,0:34:57.51, ,,0,0,0,,如果丹尼·维沃特 现在对你进行药理检查怎么办?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What if Danny Witwer came to you right now and insisted on a full chem run?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:57.56,0:34:58.68, ,,0,0,0,,拉马 我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lamar, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:00.47,0:35:04.98, ,,0,0,0,,你知道的 约翰 一旦犯罪预防计划推向全国 他们就不能阻止我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You understand, John, the minute Precrime goes national, they're going to take it away from us.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:05.08,0:35:06.59, ,,0,0,0,,我们不会允许他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We won't let them.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:06.69,0:35:10.65, ,,0,0,0,,不? 一个老男人和一个 被开除的警察怎么去阻止他们?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No? How's an old man and a cop on the whiff ever going to stop them?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:12.95,0:35:18.66, ,,0,0,0,,我父亲曾经对我说: "不是你选择信仰 而是信仰选择你"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}My father once said to me: "You don't choose the things you believe in, they choose you".
Dialogue: 1,0:35:19.91,0:35:21.04, ,,0,0,0,,那就是你为什么在这的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There's a reason you're here, John.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.70,0:35:24.08, ,,0,0,0,,如果犯罪预警机制早上马六个月...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Had Precrime been in place just six months earlier, -
Dialogue: 1,0:35:24.12,0:35:27.58, ,,0,0,0,,...你和劳拉的痛苦就可以避免\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- the loss you and Lara suffered would have been prevented.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:27.63,0:35:29.50, ,,0,0,0,,记住那些眼睛 约翰...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Remember the eyes, John...
Dialogue: 1,0:35:31.42,0:35:34.76, ,,0,0,0,,人民的眼睛正在看着我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The eyes of the nation are on us right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:35.22,0:35:37.97, ,,0,0,0,,我们都知道我的话已经没有人听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We both know Im not the generation anyone listens to.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:38.01,0:35:39.72, ,,0,0,0,,但是 人们相信你 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But, people trust you, John.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:40.18,0:35:42.81, ,,0,0,0,,只要你说绝对信任犯罪预防系统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}When you speak of your absolute belief in Precrime,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:43.31,0:35:46.26, ,,0,0,0,,他们就会明白这是一种源于痛苦而非政治的信仰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}they know it's a belief born of pain and not politics. 
Dialogue: 1,0:35:46.30,0:35:47.56, ,,0,0,0,,我一直明白这点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10} I've always understood that.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:48.02,0:35:51.36, ,,0,0,0,,我也很鼓励这种原因的信仰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And I may have even encouraged it, to help with the cause.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:53.36,0:35:56.86, ,,0,0,0,,但是现在... 你的痛苦伤害了我们两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But now... your pain is hurting both of us.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:01.62,0:36:03.79, ,,0,0,0,,他们不能 把这一切从我们身边夺走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They're not going to take it away from us.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:05.08,0:36:05.96, ,,0,0,0,,我不会允许的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I won't let them.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:37.16,0:36:38.20, ,,0,0,0,,命中!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Bingo!
Dialogue: 1,0:36:52.46,0:36:53.59, ,,0,0,0,,- "嘿 爸爸" - "你好啊 小朋友"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "Hi, daddy!" - "Hello little buddy."
Dialogue: 1,0:36:53.63,0:36:55.17, ,,0,0,0,,- "我们成立了一个俱乐部" - "是吗? "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "I made up a club." - "Yeah?"
Dialogue: 1,0:36:55.22,0:36:57.97, ,,0,0,0,,- "我们叫它帕莱斯高"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "We'll call it 'The Crushcoes."
Dialogue: 1,0:36:59.43,0:37:02.35, ,,0,0,0,,- "我们有一个足球队" - "真的? "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "We made up a soccer team." - "Yeah?"
Dialogue: 1,0:37:02.39,0:37:04.93, ,,0,0,0,,- "我们在学校练习" - "是吗? 你们练习的好吗..."\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "And we practiced at school." - "Yeah? You did you practice for..."
Dialogue: 1,0:37:05.48,0:37:07.14, ,,0,0,0,,爸爸有很多麻烦了 肖恩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Daddy's in a lot of trouble, Sean.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:38.93,0:37:42.85, ,,0,0,0,,- 杰德 为什么你没有和维沃特神父在一起? - 你不该这么情绪化\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Jad. How come you're not out there with Father Witwer? - We're in motion on something.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:43.18,0:37:47.56, ,,0,0,0,,根据我看到的情况 受害者 白人 男性 大约50岁 身高1米7左右\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}From what I can see, we got a white male-victim, about five-ten, approximately one-seventy, -
Dialogue: 1,0:37:47.89,0:37:50.02, ,,0,0,0,,...在十搂被枪击 然后掉出窗外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- takes a round in the ten ring, and goes out a window.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:50.35,0:37:51.94, ,,0,0,0,,- 红球? - 不是 棕球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Red Ball? - Nope. Brown ball.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:52.40,0:37:53.44, ,,0,0,0,,这个是有预谋的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This one is premeditated.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:53.61,0:37:56.86, ,,0,0,0,,令人惊讶的是在方圆200英里以内 居然还有人敢预谋杀人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Amazing there's someone within two hundred miles actually dumb enough to still do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:57.32,0:38:03.99, ,,0,0,0,,受害者叫里奥·克罗 这是1109号案 案发时间 星期五下午3:06\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The victim's name is Leo Crow. This is case #1109. Time of occurrence, Friday 15.06 hours.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:04.03,0:38:06.58, ,,0,0,0,,开始定位搜索 寻找未来受害人里奥·克罗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Start a location run and a contact search for future victim Leo Crow.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:06.62,0:38:12.00, ,,0,0,0,,1109号案件 根据预测师提供的镜像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Case #1109, previsualized by the Precogs and recorded on holosphere by Precrime's q-stacks.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:12.04,0:38:14.70, ,,0,0,0,,1109号案的鉴定人是凯塞琳·詹姆斯博士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}My fellow witnesses for case #1109 are Dr. Katherine James
Dialogue: 1,0:38:14.75,0:38:16.30, ,,0,0,0,,和审判长弗兰克·保罗德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}and Chief Justice Frank Pollard.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:16.63,0:38:18.09, ,,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 早上好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Good morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:18.13,0:38:20.63, ,,0,0,0,,鉴定人准备观看并鉴定1109号案件了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Are the witnesses ready to preview and validate #1109?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:21.09,0:38:22.93, ,,0,0,0,,- 你准备好了就行 约翰 - 开始吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Ready when you are, John. - Standing by.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:29.89,0:38:31.23, ,,0,0,0,,哦 我喜欢这部分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh. I love this part.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:32.98,0:38:37.61, ,,0,0,0,,我找不到地址或者其他什么 从五年前就没有记载了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I've got no address last known or otherwise, no tax returns for the last five years.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:37.90,0:38:39.69, ,,0,0,0,,去查查NCIC 他们也许有记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Check NCIC, maybe he's got a record.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:41.49,0:38:43.74, ,,0,0,0,,一找到案发地点马上派行动队过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Then send a protection team as soon as we lock location.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:48.37,0:38:50.90, ,,0,0,0,,看上去像联邦政府大楼 混凝土 玻璃 板条格天花板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Looks like federal housing. Concrete, glass, eggcrates.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:51.00,0:38:53.29, ,,0,0,0,,天那 这个区至少有上千座这种楼房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Ouch. There's a thousand of those in the District.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:55.20,0:38:56.99, ,,0,0,0,,有新图像了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}fresh image just come in...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:57.59,0:38:58.50, ,,0,0,0,,数字...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Numbers...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:58.68,0:38:59.68, ,,0,0,0,,9...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Nine...
Dialogue: 1,0:39:02.55,0:39:03.68, ,,0,0,0,,和6\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...and six.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:09.01,0:39:12.89, ,,0,0,0,,女性 老人 她在抽烟...烟斗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Female. Senior. She's smoking a...pipe.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:14.06,0:39:15.06, ,,0,0,0,,她在笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She's laughing.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:18.61,0:39:20.28, ,,0,0,0,,好啦 现在进到一个房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Okay. Now inside a room.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:21.78,0:39:23.86, ,,0,0,0,,窗玻璃 映出人影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Windowpanes, illumine exclusion.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:24.91,0:39:27.37, ,,0,0,0,,两个不太清晰的人影?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What two figures resolving in the room?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:34.96,0:39:36.92, ,,0,0,0,,看来我们有个第三者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Looks like we got a third party.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:37.92,0:39:39.71, ,,0,0,0,,戴着太阳眼镜 在窗外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wearing sunglasses just out the window...
Dialogue: 1,0:39:41.21,0:39:42.55, ,,0,0,0,,你不会杀我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're not gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:46.09,0:39:47.26, ,,0,0,0,,再见 克罗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Good-bye, Crow.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:53.56,0:39:54.77, ,,0,0,0,,"你不会杀了我的"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"You're not gonna kill me."
Dialogue: 1,0:39:55.69,0:39:57.06, ,,0,0,0,,- "再见 克罗" - "安德顿 等一下"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "Good-bye, Crow." - "Anderton! Wait!"
Dialogue: 1,0:40:04.24,0:40:07.36, ,,0,0,0,,- 你说了什么 长官? - 没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You say something, Chief? - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:10.99,0:40:11.74, ,,0,0,0,,我来拿这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'll get this one.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:13.54,0:40:14.66, ,,0,0,0,,我们有充足的时间办这案子 杰德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We got time on this one, Jad.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:15.21,0:40:19.08, ,,0,0,0,,不介意下楼去帮我买份蛋糕吧 我饿坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Mind going down getting me a piece of that cake they're eating down there? I'm starving.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:19.38,0:40:24.17, ,,0,0,0,,- 当然 长官 顺便也可以为我自己买一份 - 不着急\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Sure, Chief. I think I'll get one for myself while I'm at it. - Take your time.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:41.53,0:40:45.36, ,,0,0,0,,安德顿长官 我看到了什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Chief Anderton. What is this that I...see?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:46.07,0:40:47.20, ,,0,0,0,,我很困惑...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm confused about...
Dialogue: 1,0:41:19.48,0:41:20.85, ,,0,0,0,,- "安德顿 等一下" - "再见 克罗"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "Anderton. Wait!" - "Good-bye, Crow."
Dialogue: 1,0:41:20.90,0:41:22.36, ,,0,0,0,,"等一下 安德顿 等一下"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Wait! Anderton. Wait!"
Dialogue: 1,0:41:25.32,0:41:26.15, ,,0,0,0,,"安德顿 等一下"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Anderton. Wait!"
Dialogue: 1,0:41:32.99,0:41:34.41, ,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你 长官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I like you, Chief.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:34.62,0:41:35.83, ,,0,0,0,,你对我一直很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're always been nice to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:39.29,0:41:41.17, ,,0,0,0,,我会给你两分钟时间 在我拉响警报以前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'll give you two minutes before I hit the alarm.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:58.52,0:42:01.69, ,,0,0,0,,请等一下 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Hold that, please. Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:06.03,0:42:07.28, ,,0,0,0,,你有大麻烦了 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're in a lot of trouble, John.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:07.99,0:42:08.78, ,,0,0,0,,你陷害我...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You set me up...
Dialogue: 1,0:42:09.53,0:42:12.11, ,,0,0,0,,我在报告里面提到了你有妄想症 你整夜吸毒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'll write the paranoia off to the whiff you've been doping on all night.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:14.33,0:42:15.62, ,,0,0,0,,- 放松点 - 看起来我找到缺陷了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Easy. - It seems I've found a flaw.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:19.29,0:42:19.91, ,,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:19.96,0:42:23.29, ,,0,0,0,,单就这件事你就要坐六个月牢 更别提你的证章了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Possession alone will cost you six months, not to mention your badge.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:23.33,0:42:25.17, ,,0,0,0,,我猜我们不能一起工作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I guess we won't be working together after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:25.96,0:42:28.46, ,,0,0,0,,现在放下枪 我可不希望听说又有红球事件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Now put the gun down, John. I don't hear a Red Ball.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:51.40,0:42:53.49, ,,0,0,0,,拉马! 拉马!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lamar! Lamar!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:55.91,0:42:58.08, ,,0,0,0,,- 拉马! - 约翰 出什么事了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Lamar! - John. What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:58.12,0:43:00.08, ,,0,0,0,,- 维沃特陷害我 - 出什么见鬼的事了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It's Witwer he set me up! - What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:00.12,0:43:01.41, ,,0,0,0,,- 他陷害我 - 约翰 等等...谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He set me up! - John, just wait...who...?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:01.46,0:43:04.92, ,,0,0,0,,- 他陷害我 维沃特 是维沃特 他... - 是吗? 谁是受害者?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He set me up! Witwer it's Witwer! He... - Yeah, who's the victim?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:05.25,0:43:06.58, ,,0,0,0,,- 某人 - 谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Somebody. - Who?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:07.42,0:43:09.17, ,,0,0,0,,- 某人...里奥·克罗 - 那是谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Someone...Leo Crow. - Who is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:09.21,0:43:11.97, ,,0,0,0,,我不知道 从来没听说过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I have no idea. I've never heard of him.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:12.43,0:43:14.72, ,,0,0,0,,但我被认为不到36个小时之后会杀了他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But I'm supposed to kill him in less than 36 hours.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:15.89,0:43:18.85, ,,0,0,0,,- 维沃特怎么能进入系统呢? - 他假造了输出信号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- How could Witwer have accessed the case file? - He faked his cerebral output.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:19.18,0:43:20.43, ,,0,0,0,,- 为什么不是别人呢? - 你觉得呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Why would anyone want to? - Can you?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:20.52,0:43:22.98, ,,0,0,0,,- 我很怀疑这一点 - 但是...海因曼知道原因吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- But I doubt it very much. - But would...would Hineman know?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:24.27,0:43:25.23, ,,0,0,0,,- 过来吧 - 什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Come in. - What?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:25.27,0:43:27.77, ,,0,0,0,,- 我们会保护你的安全 直到这件事被查清楚 - 不 不 不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Well I'll keep you safe until we get to the bottom of this. - No no no.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:28.11,0:43:31.07, ,,0,0,0,,拉马 听我说 听着 和沃利谈谈 看看维沃特有没有又进过神殿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lamar, listen to me, listen, talk to Wally, see if Witwer's gone inside the temple again.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:31.11,0:43:35.03, ,,0,0,0,,问问杰德有关下班时间的 门禁系统里的眼部扫瞄记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Then ask Jad for any off hour EYEdents into the analytical room.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:35.66,0:43:37.66, ,,0,0,0,,约翰 告诉我 谁是里奥·克罗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John. Just tell me, who's Leo Crow?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:37.70,0:43:39.03, ,,0,0,0,,一级安全防范激活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Security lockdown enabled.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:39.24,0:43:40.66, ,,0,0,0,,修正目的地:办公室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Revised Destination: Office.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:40.70,0:43:41.37, ,,0,0,0,,拉马 他们发现我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lamar, they have found me.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:47.71,0:43:51.96, ,,0,0,0,,- 有什么办法解除锁定吗? 约翰? - 没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Is there any way to override the lockdown? John? - No, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:52.30,0:43:53.09, ,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 没有?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- No. - No?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:53.13,0:43:54.55, ,,0,0,0,,我可以在你说的任何地方和你见面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'll meet you anywhere you say.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:55.01,0:43:56.59, ,,0,0,0,,- 拉马 - 你可以来我这里 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Lamar. - You can come to my house, John.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:56.68,0:43:59.72, ,,0,0,0,,你知道我不能 他们会抓我 我不要戴头夹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You know I can't. They'll get me. I'm not gonna get halo.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.76,0:44:00.76, ,,0,0,0,,你不能逃怕 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You can't run, John.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:02.27,0:44:03.23, ,,0,0,0,,每个人都会逃跑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Everybody runs.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:06.62,0:45:08.71, ,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 你还好吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, my gosh. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:12.59,0:45:14.71, ,,0,0,0,,别担心 先生 我会把他平安带回来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Don't worry, sir. I'll bring him in unharmed.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:14.84,0:45:16.34, ,,0,0,0,,事实上 戈登 你不必这样做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Actually, Gordon, you're not gonna do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:16.80,0:45:18.59, ,,0,0,0,,- 我来接管队伍 - 什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I'm taking control of the team. - What?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:19.09,0:45:22.35, ,,0,0,0,,维沃特 弗雷彻是副队长 这是他负责的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Witwer, Fletcher is second in command. It's his show to run.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.39,0:45:23.43, ,,0,0,0,,如果你想 你可以监督\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you want, you can observe.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:23.97,0:45:26.56, ,,0,0,0,,- 去吧 找到他 - 是的 先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Do it. Find him. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:30.02,0:45:32.19, ,,0,0,0,,就在这事发生前几天 他来找过你 说了些什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He came to see you the other day right before he was tagged.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:33.15,0:45:34.15, ,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What did you talk about?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:34.78,0:45:38.20, ,,0,0,0,,小事情 约翰认为今年新进人员 花名册不够深入详细\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The Mets. John doesn't think they're got a deep enough pitching roster this year, -
Dialogue: 1,0:45:38.20,0:45:38.86, ,,0,0,0,,而我认为...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}and I'm inclined to...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:38.91,0:45:40.16, ,,0,0,0,,你为什么要维护他?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why are you protecting him?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:40.99,0:45:42.91, ,,0,0,0,,你早就知道他吸毒 你没有采取任何措施\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You knew he was doping, yet you did nothing about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:43.03,0:45:46.08, ,,0,0,0,,- 他失去了孩子 看在上帝的份上... - 六年以前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- The man lost a child, for Christ's sake... - Six years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:47.08,0:45:49.62, ,,0,0,0,,- 你们两个说了什么? - 和你见鬼的任务无关\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- What did you two talk about? - None of your damn business.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:49.67,0:45:51.08, ,,0,0,0,,现在 所有这些 都和我的见鬼任务有关 拉马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, it's all my damn business now, Lamar.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.83,0:45:55.63, ,,0,0,0,,我负责调查与监控严重罪案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Investigation of a supervising office for a capital crime falls under federal jurisdiction, -
Dialogue: 1,0:45:55.67,0:45:59.97, ,,0,0,0,,防止任何共谋的可能性发生 他是我的嫌疑犯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- so as to rule out any possibility of conspiracy. He's my suspect.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:00.30,0:46:02.43, ,,0,0,0,,- 他是我的下属 - 我们给司法部长打个电话如何?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He's my subordinate! - Shall we call the Attorney General?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:02.97,0:46:04.64, ,,0,0,0,,我想他会很乐意给你澄清问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm sure he'll be happy to clarify the issue for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:05.26,0:46:07.35, ,,0,0,0,,我不希望约翰·安德顿受伤害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't want John Anderton hurt.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:10.77,0:46:11.81, ,,0,0,0,,我喜欢在这工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm gonna enjoy working here.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:15.73,0:46:19.28, ,,0,0,0,,"通往沙漠边缘之路...莱克撒斯"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"A road to verges in the desert...Lexus."
Dialogue: 1,0:46:20.40,0:46:23.49, ,,0,0,0,,"约翰·安德顿 你不想来一次小旅行吗? "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"The road your on, John Anderton, is the one less travel..."
Dialogue: 1,0:46:29.71,0:46:31.00, ,,0,0,0,,"晚上好 约翰·安德顿"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Good evening, John Anderton..."
Dialogue: 1,0:46:34.92,0:46:35.59, ,,0,0,0,,"约翰·安德顿"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"John Anderton!"
Dialogue: 1,0:46:36.42,0:46:38.34, ,,0,0,0,,"你可以现在享受一大瓶啤酒"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"You can use a Guinness Draught by now..."
Dialogue: 1,0:46:38.92,0:46:40.17, ,,0,0,0,,"从所有的问题中解脱出来"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Escape from it all".
Dialogue: 1,0:46:40.80,0:46:42.26, ,,0,0,0,,"摆脱压力 约翰·安德顿"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Stress out, John Anderton."
Dialogue: 1,0:46:44.68,0:46:46.26, ,,0,0,0,,"逃开吧 约翰·安德顿"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Get away. John Anderton."
Dialogue: 1,0:46:46.56,0:46:47.60, ,,0,0,0,,"忘记你的烦恼"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Forget your troubles..."
Dialogue: 1,0:47:06.33,0:47:07.70, ,,0,0,0,,在伦敦地下车站发现他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's been idented on the Metro.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:08.41,0:47:10.54, ,,0,0,0,,火车停了两站 在28到33段之间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The train makes two stops, at 20th and then 33rd.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:11.25,0:47:12.29, ,,0,0,0,,派行动队包围他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Send units, siege location.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:12.33,0:47:14.33, ,,0,0,0,,- 他们不够20人 - 要有信念\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- They'll never make 20th. - Have faith.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:55.67,0:47:56.63, ,,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Fire 'em up!
Dialogue: 1,0:48:21.32,0:48:22.65, ,,0,0,0,,- 你好 弗雷彻 - 你好 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Hey Fletch. - Hey John.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:23.32,0:48:24.90, ,,0,0,0,,- 是个很糟的着陆 - 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- That was a rough landing. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:25.82,0:48:26.65, ,,0,0,0,,你需要多练习\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You have to work on that.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:28.87,0:48:29.62, ,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:30.79,0:48:32.24, ,,0,0,0,,嘿 别这样干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Hey, don't do this.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:33.58,0:48:36.12, ,,0,0,0,,约翰 不要逃跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John. Don't run.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:37.21,0:48:38.17, ,,0,0,0,,你不一定要追我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You don't have to chase me.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:39.63,0:48:40.67, ,,0,0,0,,你不一定要跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You don't have to run.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:41.67,0:48:43.05, ,,0,0,0,,每个人都会逃跑 弗雷彻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Everybody runs, Fletch.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:43.72,0:48:44.59, ,,0,0,0,,你知道我们会抓住你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You know we'll catch you.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:46.63,0:48:47.76, ,,0,0,0,,每个人都会逃跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Everybody runs.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:50.60,0:48:53.06, ,,0,0,0,,- 你大可不必这样 约翰 - 每个人都会逃跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It doesn't have to be like this, John. - Everybody runs.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:54.64,0:48:55.85, ,,0,0,0,,准备好武器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Get your sick-sticks ready.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:58.15,0:48:59.73, ,,0,0,0,,每个人都会跑 弗雷彻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Everybody runs, Fletch.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:00.61,0:49:02.53, ,,0,0,0,,过来 长官 放松点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Slow down, Chief. Just take it easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:06.78,0:49:08.28, ,,0,0,0,,别突然移动 长官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No sudden moves, Chief.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:10.24,0:49:12.33, ,,0,0,0,,约翰 这没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John. It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:12.66,0:49:13.95, ,,0,0,0,,- 弗雷彻 - 放松点 长官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Fletch. - Easy does it, Chief.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:43.36,0:49:45.57, ,,0,0,0,,- 抓紧了吗? 抓紧了吗? - 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Got a grip? Got a grip?! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:11.89,0:50:14.30, ,,0,0,0,,长官 长官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Chief. Chief. Chief!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:15.31,0:50:16.56, ,,0,0,0,,安德顿!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anderton!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.71,0:50:50.13, ,,0,0,0,,滚出去! 滚出我的厨房!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Go away! Get out of my kitchen!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:58.47,0:51:01.44, ,,0,0,0,,- 安德顿! 收手吧 - 把他从我身上拉下来 弗雷彻 把他拉下来!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Anderton! Stop! - Pull him off me, Fletcher. Get him off me!
Dialogue: 1,0:51:34.97,0:51:38.89, ,,0,0,0,,遵照哥伦比亚特区犯罪预防部的命令 我拘捕你...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}By mandate of the District of Columbia Precrime division, I'm placing you under arrest...
Dialogue: 1,0:51:39.89,0:51:40.77, ,,0,0,0,,睡吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.16,0:52:02.95, ,,0,0,0,,你们跟我来!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You stay with me!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:34.52,0:56:38.61, ,,0,0,0,,- 海因曼博士 - 你随便闯入 我不接待来访者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Dr. Hineman. - You're trespassing I don't have visitors.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:45.20,0:56:47.41, ,,0,0,0,,哦 恐怕这是那些藤曼造成的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, I'm afraid that would be from the Doll's Eye.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:47.45,0:56:50.87, ,,0,0,0,,藤曼...会在擦破你皮肤时注入毒液 因为你未经许可翻我的围墙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The vine...the Baneberry that scratched you during your illegal climb over my wall...
Dialogue: 1,0:56:50.91,0:56:53.91, ,,0,0,0,,它不是真的藤曼 当然 是我自己设计的一点小东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's not a true Doll's Eye, of course, but a little hybrid of my own design.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:53.96,0:56:56.87, ,,0,0,0,,它很不同寻常 一旦毒素进入你的血液\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's quite something, once the poison gets into your bloodstream, -
Dialogue: 1,0:56:56.92,0:56:58.71, ,,0,0,0,,你就会看见那些 我称之为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}you'll start to see what I can only describe as
Dialogue: 1,0:56:58.75,0:57:02.30, ,,0,0,0,,让人沮丧的事物的特别展览\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}the most extraordinary display of blue objects.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:03.76,0:57:06.72, ,,0,0,0,,这不是你想要的对吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This just isn't your week, is it...
Dialogue: 1,0:57:08.97,0:57:09.97, ,,0,0,0,,安德顿长官\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Chief Anderton.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:12.64,0:57:13.60, ,,0,0,0,,我不是凶手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm not a killer.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:20.77,0:57:21.61, ,,0,0,0,,你最好喝了这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You better drink this.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:21.90,0:57:24.32, ,,0,0,0,,很快你就不能吞咽东西了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Soon you won't be able to swallow, and then you'll be totally buggered.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:27.53,0:57:28.32, ,,0,0,0,,全喝了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:29.20,0:57:31.66, ,,0,0,0,,好了 现在稍微休息调整一下 会觉的好些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Okay. Now take a minute to right yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:34.12,0:57:36.91, ,,0,0,0,,刚才... 你认为我能帮你什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just...what is it you think I can do for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:40.38,0:57:41.63, ,,0,0,0,,你能告诉我...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You can tell me how someone...
Dialogue: 1,0:57:43.34,0:57:44.59, ,,0,0,0,,如何能伪造预知镜像吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can fake a prevision.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:44.71,0:57:45.71, ,,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How would I know that?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:47.09,0:57:48.38, ,,0,0,0,,因为你发明了这个系统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Because you invented Precrime.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:51.68,0:57:52.39, ,,0,0,0,,这很好笑吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:53.89,0:57:57.02, ,,0,0,0,,这是一系列基因工程错误引起的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If the unintended consequences of a series of genetic mistakes -
Dialogue: 1,0:57:57.06,0:57:58.60, ,,0,0,0,,简直一团糟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}and science gone haywire
Dialogue: 1,0:57:58.90,0:58:01.77, ,,0,0,0,,也能被称为发明 是的 是我发明的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}can be called invention, yes, then I invented Precrime.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:02.02,0:58:03.23, ,,0,0,0,,你看上去不怎么自豪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You don't seem all that proud.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:03.27,0:58:06.11, ,,0,0,0,,一点都不 我试着治疗他们 不想让他们成为别的什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm not. I was trying to heal them, not turn them into something else.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:07.03,0:58:08.11, ,,0,0,0,,治疗谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Heal who?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:08.15,0:58:10.11, ,,0,0,0,,我们用来制止犯罪的那些无辜的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The innocents we now use to stop the guilty.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:10.62,0:58:11.36, ,,0,0,0,,你是在说...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're talking about...
Dialogue: 1,0:58:12.83,0:58:14.16, ,,0,0,0,,预言师...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}the Precogs...
Dialogue: 1,0:58:14.20,0:58:16.29, ,,0,0,0,,你以为水箱里那三个人 是试管培养出来的吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You think the three in the tank come out of a test tube?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:16.45,0:58:18.83, ,,0,0,0,,他们仅仅是幸存者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They are merely the ones who survived.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:19.42,0:58:23.25, ,,0,0,0,,我当时在伍德海文诊所 治疗那些吸毒成瘾的孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I was doing genetic research at the Woodhaven Clinic treating children of drug addicts.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:23.29,0:58:26.51, ,,0,0,0,,十年前烈洛因第一次在大街上出现时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This was ten years ago when neuroin at first hit the streets.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:26.55,0:58:30.05, ,,0,0,0,,那是一种不纯的毒品 不是基因工程鸡尾酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It was an empure form of the drug not the engineered cocktail, -
Dialogue: 1,0:58:30.09,0:58:32.89, ,,0,0,0,,在受过高等教育的人群里非常流行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}that became so popular among the more educated.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:34.60,0:58:37.37, ,,0,0,0,,所有这些孩子从一出生大脑 就受到毒品的严重伤害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All of these kids where born with severe brain damage.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:37.40,0:58:39.27, ,,0,0,0,,大部分在12岁之前就死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Most died before the age of twelve.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:40.27,0:58:43.19, ,,0,0,0,,幸存者很少 这些幸存的孩子很珍贵 他们有一种天赋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There was few, there was precious few who survived, they had a gift.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:43.23,0:58:45.77, ,,0,0,0,,我称之为天赋 但其实更像一个宇宙的玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I called it a gift for them it was more like a cosmic joke.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:46.94,0:58:47.94, ,,0,0,0,,他们会在夜里醒来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They would wake up in the night.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:48.49,0:58:51.11, ,,0,0,0,,蜷在房间的一角 尖叫 紧紧靠着墙壁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Curled up in a corner of the room, screaming, clunging at the wallpaper.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:51.61,0:58:55.70, ,,0,0,0,,因为当这些孩子在夜里一闭上眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Because when these little children, you see, closed their eyes at night.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:56.24,0:59:01.00, ,,0,0,0,,他们不停的梦到凶杀 一个接着一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They dreamt only of murder over and over, one after the other.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:01.04,0:59:02.83, ,,0,0,0,,没有过多久我们就意识到...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And it didn't take long for us to realize, -
Dialogue: 1,0:59:03.04,0:59:06.13, ,,0,0,0,,那些被称为梦境的如此真实的梦魇...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}that the real nightmare was that these so-called dreams -
Dialogue: 1,0:59:06.17,0:59:09.38, ,,0,0,0,,其实就是事实上即将会发生的凶杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}were about to come true these murders were actually happening.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:13.68,0:59:15.64, ,,0,0,0,,你是说有些孩子死了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You say some of the children died?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:17.02,0:59:19.51, ,,0,0,0,,无论我们怎样努力 他们大部分都死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So many of them despite what we did for them.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:19.60,0:59:21.81, ,,0,0,0,,或许正是因为我们对他们的所作所为才害死了他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Or maybe because of what we did to them.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:21.85,0:59:25.69, ,,0,0,0,,但是没什么关系 现在这是个完美的系统 不是吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But it doesn't matter. It's a perfect system now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:28.23,0:59:29.32, ,,0,0,0,,我不会犯谋杀罪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm not gonna commit murder.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:30.70,0:59:32.32, ,,0,0,0,,我根本不认识那个可能会被我杀掉的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I've never even met the man I'll supposed to kill.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:33.03,0:59:37.49, ,,0,0,0,,但是 事情已经开始了 一条线索会引导你最终实施对他的谋杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And, yet, a chain of events has started. A chain that will lead you inexorably to his murder.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:37.66,0:59:40.16, ,,0,0,0,,- 如果我避而不见他呢? - 你怎么能躲过一个你从来没见过的人?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Not if I stay away from him. - How can you avoid a man you're never met?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:40.16,0:59:41.08, ,,0,0,0,,那么说你不会帮我了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So you won't help me?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:41.37,0:59:45.92, ,,0,0,0,,我无能为力 没有人可以帮你 预言师从来没有失误过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I can't help you. Nobody can. The Precogs are never wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:48.96,0:59:51.42, ,,0,0,0,,但是 偶尔...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But, occasionally,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:51.51,0:59:52.88, ,,0,0,0,,...他们的预言不一致\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}they do disagree.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:55.39,0:59:56.85, ,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:56.89,1:00:01.06, ,,0,0,0,,大部分时候 三个预言师会看到同样的事件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Most of the time, all three Precognitives will see an event in the same way.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:01.10,1:00:04.85, ,,0,0,0,,但是偶尔 他们其中的一个看到的镜像 是不同于其他两个人的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But once in a while, one of them will see things differently than the other two.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:05.36,1:00:06.44, ,,0,0,0,,天哪!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:07.27,1:00:08.44, ,,0,0,0,,为什么我从不知道?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why didn't I know about this?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:10.69,1:00:14.78, ,,0,0,0,,- 因为这些少数派报告一出现就会被删除 - 为什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Because these Minority Reports are destroyed the instant they occur. - Why?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:14.95,1:00:19.58, ,,0,0,0,,很明显 做为犯罪预防来说 是不允许有任何不可靠信息的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Obviously, for Precrime to function, there can't be any suggestion of fallibility.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:19.99,1:00:23.37, ,,0,0,0,,毕竟 在一个公正的系统里注入怀疑有什么好处呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}After all, what good is a Justice system that instills doubt?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:23.41,1:00:25.33, ,,0,0,0,,或许是有道理 但是这还是值得怀疑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It may be reasonable, but it's still doubt.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:28.21,1:00:30.42, ,,0,0,0,,你是说我冤枉了好人?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Are you saying that I've haloll innocent people?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:30.55,1:00:34.72, ,,0,0,0,,我是说有那么多被指控为未来犯罪的人...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm saying that every so often those accused of a precrime might, -
Dialogue: 1,1:00:34.76,1:00:36.68, ,,0,0,0,,只是可能 但或许他们有一个不同的未来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}just might, have an alternate future.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:37.51,1:00:41.68, ,,0,0,0,,伯吉斯知道这事吗? 关于这个少数派报告?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Does Burgess know about this? About this Minority Report?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:42.06,1:00:45.14, ,,0,0,0,,我常常和拉马开玩笑 说我们是犯罪预防部的父亲和母亲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I used to joke with Lamar that we were the mother and father of Precrime.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:45.19,1:00:45.99, ,,0,0,0,,嗯 以我的经验来看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Well, in my experience, 
Dialogue: 1,1:00:46.10,1:00:50.15, ,,0,0,0,,父母总是把孩子 按照自己期望的样子看待 而不是以他们的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}parents very often see their children as they want them to be, not as they are...

Dialogue: 1,1:00:50.19,1:00:54.32, ,,0,0,0,,回答我 拉马·伯吉斯知道少数派报告吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Answer my question. Does Lamar Burgess know about the Minority Report?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:55.61,1:00:56.88, ,,0,0,0,,是的 当然 他知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yes, of course, he knew,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:57.61,1:01:03.08, ,,0,0,0,,但是同时 我们都觉得 这种报告的存在是无足轻重的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}but at the time, he felt, we both felt their existence was an insignificant variable.

Dialogue: 1,1:01:03.12,1:01:04.67, ,,0,0,0,,对你来说或许无足轻重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Insignificant to you maybe,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:05.12,1:01:08.37, ,,0,0,0,,但是那些被我抓走的人呢? 他们的另一种未来?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}but what about those people I put away with alternate futures?

Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.17,1:01:11.26, ,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 如果人们知道可能会有一种机会...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}My God, if the country knew there was a chance...
Dialogue: 1,1:01:11.30,1:01:12.76, ,,0,0,0,,那这个系统就完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The system would collapse.

Dialogue: 1,1:01:15.17,1:01:17.59, ,,0,0,0,,- 我信任这个系统... - 真的吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I believe in that system... - Do you really?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:18.09,1:01:18.93, ,,0,0,0,,你想毁灭它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You wanna bring it down.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:19.26,1:01:20.68, ,,0,0,0,,你会毁灭它...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You will bring it down,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:20.72,1:01:23.10, ,,0,0,0,,...如果你想杀了你的受害者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}if you manage to kill your victim.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:23.60,1:01:28.73, ,,0,0,0,,为什么不呢 那将会是最有利的证据 证明犯罪预警系统...无效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why, that will be the most spectacular public display of how Precrime...didn't work.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:29.06,1:01:31.36, ,,0,0,0,,- 我不会杀任何人 - 秉持这个信念吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I'm not gonna kill anybody. - Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:32.19,1:01:33.02, ,,0,0,0,,为什么我要信任你?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why should I trust you?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:33.74,1:01:35.24, ,,0,0,0,,你没必要 你没必要相信任何人...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You shouldn't. You shouldn't trust anyone... -
Dialogue: 1,1:01:35.28,1:01:38.57, ,,0,0,0,,...也不要相信那个自以为是的司法部长\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- certainly not the Attorney General who just wants it all for himself.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:38.61,1:01:41.66, ,,0,0,0,,或是那个想砸你饭碗的年轻联邦探员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Not the young federal agent who wants your job.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:41.70,1:01:46.16, ,,0,0,0,,甚至是那个只会炫耀自己创造成果的老头 不要相信任何人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Not even the old man who just wants to hang onto what he has created. Don't trust anyone.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:46.50,1:01:48.42, ,,0,0,0,,去找少数派报告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just find the Minority Report.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:51.79,1:01:53.59, ,,0,0,0,,但你说少数派报告已经被销毁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You said the Minority Report was destroyed.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:53.76,1:01:56.80, ,,0,0,0,,记录是销毁了 但是原本的报告还在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The record is destroyed. The original report still exists.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:57.26,1:01:59.76, ,,0,0,0,,无论何时 一旦一个报告生成 我设计的系统...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I designed the system so that whenever a report occurred, -
Dialogue: 1,1:01:59.80,1:02:02.51, ,,0,0,0,,会把它存在一个安全的地方而不会被销毁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- it would be stored in a safe place but not declared.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.14,1:02:04.06, ,,0,0,0,,什么安全的地方?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What safe place is that?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:05.52,1:02:10.73, ,,0,0,0,,- 安全的地方是在... - 在哪?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- The safest place there is... - Where is it?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:14.03,1:02:18.07, ,,0,0,0,,在做出这个镜像的预言师的身体里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Inside the Precog who predicted it.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:22.58,1:02:25.95, ,,0,0,0,,你所要做的就是把它们下载下来 亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All you have to do is download it, darling.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:28.83,1:02:29.83, ,,0,0,0,,就这样 嗯?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That's all, huh?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:34.13,1:02:38.67, ,,0,0,0,,只需要想办法混进犯罪预防部 进入神殿 接触预言师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just walk right into Precrime, get into the Temple, somehow tap into these Precogs, -
Dialogue: 1,1:02:38.72,1:02:42.76, ,,0,0,0,,- 然后下载少数派报告... - 如果你有一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- and then download this Minority Report... - If you have one.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:43.10,1:02:43.93, ,,0,0,0,,然后走出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And then walk out.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:44.31,1:02:47.64, ,,0,0,0,,事实上 我认为你应该跑出来 就是这样 这就是你要做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Actually, I think you'll have to run out, but yes, that is what you have to do.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:49.69,1:02:53.73, ,,0,0,0,,你疯了 你以为我是谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're insane or you think I am.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:54.86,1:02:59.61, ,,0,0,0,,早在我靠近犯罪预防部十英里的范围之前 就会受到无数次眼部扫瞄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'll get EYEscanned a dozen times before I get within ten miles of Precrime.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:00.07,1:03:04.45, ,,0,0,0,,有时候为了看到光明 你必须先冒险进入黑暗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sometimes in order to see the light, you have to risk the dark.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:05.16,1:03:08.54, ,,0,0,0,,作为一名警察...请原谅 曾经是一名警察\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}As a policeman...excuse me, a former policeman -
Dialogue: 1,1:03:08.58,1:03:13.88, ,,0,0,0,,我确信你能找到 所有在这方面能帮的上你的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I'm sure you know all sorts of people who could help you out in this regard.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:21.18,1:03:23.26, ,,0,0,0,,有趣的是所有的有机生物都很相似\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's funny how all living organisms are alike.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:23.76,1:03:27.39, ,,0,0,0,,当压力到来 危急自身的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}When the chips are down. When the pressure is on.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:27.93,1:03:33.35, ,,0,0,0,,地球上的每一种生物都只对一件事情感兴趣 那就是:\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Every creature on the face of the Earth is interested in one thing and one thing only:
Dialogue: 1,1:03:35.73,1:03:37.19, ,,0,0,0,,他们自己的生存\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's own survival.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:39.57,1:03:41.49, ,,0,0,0,,去找少数派报告吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Find the Minority Report.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:46.70,1:03:48.20, ,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道谁有那个报告?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How do I even know which one has it?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:49.66,1:03:51.96, ,,0,0,0,,它通常都在他们最有天分的那个人身上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's always in the more gifted of the three.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:54.54,1:03:55.46, ,,0,0,0,,是谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Which one is that?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:59.42,1:04:00.76, ,,0,0,0,,那个女孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The female.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:04.72,1:04:05.68, ,,0,0,0,,我们再看看这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Alright here's where we're at.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:05.72,1:04:07.64, ,,0,0,0,,房间里有三个人 受害者在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Three men in a room. The victim is here.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:08.06,1:04:09.60, ,,0,0,0,,约翰在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John is here.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:09.81,1:04:12.81, ,,0,0,0,,这个身份不明的男子在窗外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And this unidentified male out the window.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:12.85,1:04:14.81, ,,0,0,0,,对面的建筑像是政府的福利公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The adjacent building suggests public housing,
Dialogue: 1,1:04:14.85,1:04:16.81, ,,0,0,0,,但是我还不能确定犯罪地点 也就是说...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}but I can't make out the location. Which means...
Dialogue: 1,1:04:16.86,1:04:18.44, ,,0,0,0,,这个城里有上千的类似建筑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There's thousands of units like this one.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:18.48,1:04:19.36, ,,0,0,0,,他可能在任何地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:19.86,1:04:22.15, ,,0,0,0,,但是他在22小时之内是不会去杀里奥·克罗的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But he doesn't go there to kill Crow for another twenty-two hours.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:22.20,1:04:24.99, ,,0,0,0,,对不起 这是安德顿长官的位置 你不能坐他的... \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Excuse me this is Chief Anderton's space you can sit in his... 
Dialogue: 1,1:04:25.00,1:04:26.16, ,,0,0,0,, 他不会再来这了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's not here anymore.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:26.16,1:04:27.57, ,,0,0,0,,- 他会回来的 - 我表示怀疑...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He'll be back! - I doubt that...
Dialogue: 1,1:04:27.62,1:04:28.33, ,,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事...?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What happened to you...?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:28.37,1:04:30.99, ,,0,0,0,,与此同时 我打赌他现在藏在市郊某处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In the meantime, I'm betting he's somewhere in the sprawl.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:31.04,1:04:33.23, ,,0,0,0,,安德顿很聪明 他不会去那些有电子广告板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anderton's smart enough to go where electronic billboards
Dialogue: 1,1:04:33.34,1:04:34.83, ,,0,0,0,,或者其他可以暴露他身份的媒体的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}and other media can't ID him to pick his pocket.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:34.87,1:04:37.33, ,,0,0,0,,市郊的消费者较少 也就意味着有较少的扫瞄器会威胁他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There's fewer consumers down there, which means fewer scanners to target him.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:37.50,1:04:38.75, ,,0,0,0,,为什么他不干脆逃跑?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why wouldn't he just run?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:39.38,1:04:40.67, ,,0,0,0,,因为他认为他是清白的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Because he thinks he's innocent.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:43.30,1:04:44.59, ,,0,0,0,,我们把精力放在市郊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We concentrate on the sprawl.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.30,1:04:47.84, ,,0,0,0,,我们派两个飞行小组带着蜘蛛追踪器过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We do overflies in ships with two spyder teams on the ground.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:48.55,1:04:51.39, ,,0,0,0,,对整个地区进行热能扫瞄 读取每个人的眼部和心跳资料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Thermal scan the entire area, read anything with eyes and a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:08.78,1:05:09.62, ,,0,0,0,,她在哪?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Where is she?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:38.06,1:05:39.02, ,,0,0,0,,真冷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This damn cold.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:41.48,1:05:42.02, ,,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:42.73,1:05:46.70, ,,0,0,0,,你看 我能切开你的胸腔 缝进一只死猫但绝对不会感染\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You see. I could cut open your chest, sew a dead cat in there and you'll never get an infection.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:46.74,1:05:49.74, ,,0,0,0,,我会给你打抗生素 防止感染\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Not with the spectrum of antibios I'll be shooting into you.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:50.58,1:05:51.53, ,,0,0,0,,那真让人感到安慰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That's comforting.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:52.20,1:05:55.16, ,,0,0,0,,你知道我可以只给你更换新虹膜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You do understand I can't just give you new irises.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:55.87,1:05:56.83, ,,0,0,0,,别碰那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Please don't touch.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:57.29,1:05:59.79, ,,0,0,0,,因为扫瞄器会发现疤痕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Because the scanners will read the new scar tissue.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:59.83,1:06:02.96, ,,0,0,0,,警报响过以后 大批的武装警察出现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Alarms will go off and large men with guns will appear.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:06.63,1:06:07.34, ,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What was that?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:08.63,1:06:09.59, ,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What was that?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:09.64,1:06:14.76, ,,0,0,0,,- 止血剂 会有帮助 - 你总是这样偷偷摸摸的对你的病人吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It's anesthesia. It's all gonna be downhill. - When you sneak up on you patients like that?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:14.89,1:06:17.85, ,,0,0,0,,你不能在音乐会之前弄伤小提琴家的手啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You wouldn't break the hand of a violinist before the concert.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:18.56,1:06:19.94, ,,0,0,0,,摆脱 放松\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Please, relax.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:25.03,1:06:29.07, ,,0,0,0,,我所想告诉你的就是我要更换你的整个眼球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All I'm trying to tell you is that I'll have to remove your eyes completely.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:30.66,1:06:31.53, ,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I know.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:32.87,1:06:36.08, ,,0,0,0,,- 我不得不用新的替代 - 我知道 但我希望能保留原来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- And I'll have to replace them with new ones. - I know that, but I wanna keep the old ones.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:36.66,1:06:37.41, ,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:38.96,1:06:40.37, ,,0,0,0,,因为那是我妈妈给我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Because my mother gave them to me.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:41.00,1:06:43.08, ,,0,0,0,,它对你有影响吗? 无论如何保留第二身份没有什么坏处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What's it to you? They're no good to you on the secondary market anyway.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:43.13,1:06:44.96, ,,0,0,0,,随你怎么说 那是你的钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Whatever you say, it's your money.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:53.60,1:06:57.02, ,,0,0,0,,让我来介绍一下我美丽的助手 范·艾可小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Let me introduce my gorgeous assistant, Miss Van Eyck.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:19.12,1:07:22.08, ,,0,0,0,,- 钱不是很多 - 那是所有我能安全使用的钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- This is not alot of money. - That's all I could safely move.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:31.84,1:07:32.80, ,,0,0,0,,你要给我戴什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What did you give me?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:34.26,1:07:40.89, ,,0,0,0,,微笑机器 告诉你 既然你我相识一场 为什么不给你个优惠价呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Smile-medicin. Tell you what, since you and I go way back, why don't I just give you my Old Pal discount.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:40.94,1:07:41.89, ,,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What do you say?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:42.27,1:07:43.65, ,,0,0,0,,你不记得我了 对吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You don't remember me, do you?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:44.65,1:07:47.02, ,,0,0,0,,- 我们认识吗? - 哦 是的 我们认识\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- We know each other? - Oh, yes, we do.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:48.65,1:07:49.69, ,,0,0,0,,在哪? 华盛顿?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}From where? D.C.?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:50.74,1:07:52.57, ,,0,0,0,,巴尔的摩 东区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Baltimore. Eastside.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:52.61,1:07:53.28, ,,0,0,0,,- 巴尔的摩? - 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Baltimore? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:53.61,1:07:54.70, ,,0,0,0,,我们怎么认识的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How do we go way back?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:55.49,1:07:59.12, ,,0,0,0,,所罗门·P·埃迪 我是个整形外科医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Solomon P. Eddie M.D. I was a plastic surgeon.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:59.75,1:08:00.45, ,,0,0,0,,你记得吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You remember?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:01.25,1:08:03.71, ,,0,0,0,,主治烧伤患者 特别是女患者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Specialized in burn victims. Mostly women.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:05.17,1:08:08.05, ,,0,0,0,,- 我抓过你... - 哦 是的 就是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I put you away... - Oh, yeah. You did.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:10.59,1:08:11.72, ,,0,0,0,,你拍的那些带子...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You made those tapes...
Dialogue: 1,1:08:13.09,1:08:14.59, ,,0,0,0,,那只是些表演片断\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They were performance pieces.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:16.97,1:08:19.47, ,,0,0,0,,你对你的病人放火!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You set your patients on fire!
Dialogue: 1,1:08:19.64,1:08:22.95, ,,0,0,0,,我把火扑灭了 只不过有些不是那么快而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I put them out. Some not as quickly as others,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:23.04,1:08:25.35, ,,0,0,0,,让我们换个话题吧 好吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10} but let's change the subject, shall we?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:28.57,1:08:32.99, ,,0,0,0,,未来比过去有意思多了 你不那么想吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The future is much more interesting than the past. Don't you think?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:36.83,1:08:39.29, ,,0,0,0,,啊 范·艾可小姐 我猜她已经等不及了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Ah, Miss Van Eyck. I'm afraid she's already smitten.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:41.45,1:08:45.25, ,,0,0,0,,她只有为你准备的眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She only has eyes for you.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:46.87,1:08:48.58, ,,0,0,0,,约翰 我知道你在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I know what you are thinking, John.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:49.04,1:08:54.88, ,,0,0,0,,我怎么会做这种事情? 这么说吧 监狱图书馆占去了我太多的时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How can I do what I do now? Well let's just say that I did spend an awful lot of time in the prison library.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:55.54,1:09:00.63, ,,0,0,0,,现在有了很多种避免监狱生活 枯燥无聊的好方法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Now that was a great way to avoid some of the more unpleasant aspects of prison life.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:01.30,1:09:03.68, ,,0,0,0,,监狱生活是一种培育 的手段 一种真正...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Confinement was a real education, a real...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:06.64,1:09:07.97, ,,0,0,0,,...让人吃惊的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...eye opener.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:12.85,1:09:16.77, ,,0,0,0,,我是说 为了练就忍耐力 事情都不是像你喜欢的那样...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I mean, for true enlightenment, there's nothing quite like, well let's say,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:17.44,1:09:20.58, ,,0,0,0,,...就像当洗澡时 一个大魔头对你不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...taking a shower while a large felon with an attitude...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:20.65,1:09:24.78, ,,0,0,0,,你恨不得一棒打倒 他还在你耳朵边私语:"南希 南希..."\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...you cann't even knockdown with a hammer, whispers in your ear: "Oh Nancy, oh Nancy..."
Dialogue: 1,1:09:25.45,1:09:29.00, ,,0,0,0,,真有趣 感谢你 约翰 给了我...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Now that was a lot of fun. Thank you so very much, John, for putting me...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:29.04,1:09:32.75, ,,0,0,0,,十分感谢你给我机会让我更好的了解自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Thank you so very much for giving me the opportunity to get to know myself so much better.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:33.38,1:09:35.29, ,,0,0,0,,而现在是该报答你了...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And now to return the favour...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:47.64,1:09:50.02, ,,0,0,0,,- 这是你的作品? - 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- This your work? - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:51.40,1:09:52.48, ,,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I like it.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:52.77,1:09:55.02, ,,0,0,0,,谢谢 你要的咖啡放点其他东西吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Thanks. You take anything in your coffee?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:55.28,1:09:57.90, ,,0,0,0,,- 奶油和糖 - 抱歉 没有奶油了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Cream and sugar. - I don't have any cream. Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:57.90,1:10:01.20, ,,0,0,0,,- 那就放点糖吧 你和约翰来过这? - 以前是 每年夏天都来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Just sugar then. You and John ever come here? - We used to, every summer.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:01.24,1:10:02.49, ,,0,0,0,,他现在不在这里 是吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's not here now, is he?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:05.58,1:10:06.58, ,,0,0,0,,我必须这样问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I had to ask.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:10.25,1:10:12.38, ,,0,0,0,,- 我连糖也没有了 - 谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You know I don't have any sugar either. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:13.00,1:10:15.84, ,,0,0,0,,- 他没有试着跟你联系? - 没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He hasn't tried to contact you? - No.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:16.34,1:10:18.13, ,,0,0,0,,你听他提过尼奥·克鲁这个名字吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You ever heard him mention the name Leo Crow?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:19.18,1:10:21.84, ,,0,0,0,,没有 但是我从不和约翰谈那么远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No, but then I don't talk to John that much anymore.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:22.14,1:10:25.18, ,,0,0,0,,- 那么你也没见过他的公寓? - 是我们的公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- So you haven't seen his apartment? - That was our apartment.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:25.31,1:10:26.64, ,,0,0,0,,最近去过那吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Have you been there recently?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:26.98,1:10:28.06, ,,0,0,0,,都是这些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's full of these.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:28.56,1:10:29.69, ,,0,0,0,,他吸毒多久了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How long has he been doped?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:31.56,1:10:36.78, ,,0,0,0,,- 自从我们丢了我们的儿子 - 你是说是你儿子丢失以后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Since right after we lost our son. - You mean after he lost your son.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:36.82,1:10:37.90, ,,0,0,0,,谁都没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It was nobody's fault.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:40.70,1:10:44.29, ,,0,0,0,,但那时约翰和儿子一起在公共游池\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But John was with him at the public pool.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:45.24,1:10:47.62, ,,0,0,0,,你在你们的离婚协议书上说 约翰试图自杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You said in your divorce papers that John tried to kill himself.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:47.91,1:10:51.42, ,,0,0,0,,- 算不上自杀 我后悔那样说 - 什么意思?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It wasn't a suicide attempt. I regret ever saying that. - What was it?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:51.46,1:10:53.96, ,,0,0,0,,FBI找到了一些属于我儿子的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The FBI found something that belonged to my son.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:54.00,1:10:57.84, ,,0,0,0,,一双凉鞋... 总之 约翰很不安 他...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}A sandal... Anyway, John was upset. He... he...
Dialogue: 1,1:10:57.88,1:11:01.39, ,,0,0,0,,- 他掏出枪 然后坐下来看家庭电影... - 他开了一枪...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He took out his gun and sat down to watch his home movies... - He shot a hole...
Dialogue: 1,1:11:01.43,1:11:04.64, ,,0,0,0,,- 劳拉 全看你的证词了 - 他朝该死的天花板开了一枪 那又怎样?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It's all on your statement, Lara. - He shot a hole in the damn ceiling. So what?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:04.68,1:11:07.52, ,,0,0,0,,就算失去了儿子 但是你得控制自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You lose your son, let's see how well you handle it.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:09.04,1:11:10.37, ,,0,0,0,,拉马尔·伯吉斯认为你离开约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}because he lost himself in Precrime instead of you.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:10.44,1:11:12.77, ,,0,0,0,,是因为他沉溺于预防犯罪而冷落了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}because he lost himself in Precrime instead of you.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:14.78,1:11:18.74, ,,0,0,0,,我离开他 是因为每次我看着他 我就想起了我的儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I left him because everytime I looked at him, I saw my son.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:20.45,1:11:23.24, ,,0,0,0,,每次我接近他 我就感觉到我可怜的孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Every time I got close to him, I smelled my little boy.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:24.75,1:11:26.71, ,,0,0,0,,所以我离开了他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That's why I left him.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:28.67,1:11:30.08, ,,0,0,0,,现在你可以走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And now you can leave.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:32.71,1:11:34.75, ,,0,0,0,,12个小时内别拆绷带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Don't take the bandages off for twelve hours.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:40.80,1:11:44.72, ,,0,0,0,,如果提前拆 你就会变瞎的 知道吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you take them off before then, you'l go blind. Understand?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:46.35,1:11:49.94, ,,0,0,0,,冰箱里有牛奶和三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In the fridge there is milk and sandwiches.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:50.15,1:11:51.90, ,,0,0,0,,一定要多喝水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Make sure you drink a lot of water.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:53.53,1:11:54.73, ,,0,0,0,,我怎么去厕所?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How do I find the bathroom?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:56.03,1:11:58.70, ,,0,0,0,,厕所...在你的右手边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The bathroom... now that's your right hand.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:02.24,1:12:03.54, ,,0,0,0,,厨房在左边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The kitchen is your left.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:06.79,1:12:08.96, ,,0,0,0,,别乱摸 千万不要乱摸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Don't scratch. Never scratch!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:10.38,1:12:14.42, ,,0,0,0,,看 我们都是老朋友了 我给你点额外品 也许迟早会派上用场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Seeing as we're being old pals and all, I'm gonna give you a bonus, might come in handy.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:14.97,1:12:17.11, ,,0,0,0,,这是一种临时性瘫痪?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is a temporary paralytic enzyme,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:17.20,1:12:20.22, ,,0,0,0,,- 从下巴注入你的身体 - 这是干吗用的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You're gonna shoot this baby up there right under your chin. - What is this?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:20.26,1:12:22.68, ,,0,0,0,,用来改变你的形象\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All is gonna turn your pretty face into mush.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:23.02,1:12:24.64, ,,0,0,0,,那样人们就认不出你了 知道吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}People won't even recognize you, okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:25.60,1:12:27.34, ,,0,0,0,,会有30分钟的持续紧凑感 但不会伤害你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In thirty minutes you're tightening up but it's gonna hurt
Dialogue: 1,1:12:27.60,1:12:29.94, ,,0,0,0,,然后就像什么事都没发生一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}like nothing you ever felt before.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:30.27,1:12:32.82, ,,0,0,0,,把这个放进你的百宝箱 和你的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Gonna put this in your goodie bag together with your...
Dialogue: 1,1:12:34.40,1:12:35.74, ,,0,0,0,,...宝贝放一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}... leftovers.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:37.99,1:12:42.70, ,,0,0,0,,我给你定个时间 闹钟一响 你就可以拆下你的绷带了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm setting up a timer. When it rings tomorrow you can take off the bandages...
Dialogue: 1,1:12:42.74,1:12:47.29, ,,0,0,0,,- 然后离开这里 但是不要提前拆 否则... - 变瞎 我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- and get the hell out of here. But not before then, or you'll go... - Go blind. I know.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:47.79,1:12:54.55, ,,0,0,0,,别乱抓 那可是我们的阴阳人 朋友给的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Don't scratch! A little something from our mutual friend of ours.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:32.34,1:13:34.51, ,,0,0,0,,12小时内别取下绷带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Don't take the bandages off for twelve hours."
Dialogue: 1,1:13:35.84,1:13:39.97, ,,0,0,0,,"如果提前取你就会变成瞎子 知道吧? "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"If you take them off before then, you'll go blind. Understand?"
Dialogue: 1,1:14:01.29,1:14:04.04, ,,0,0,0,,25.16秒 一个新的记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}25.16 seconds, that's a new record.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:04.62,1:14:06.88, ,,0,0,0,,- 是世界记录吗? - 是世界...?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Is that a world record? - Is it a world...?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:08.63,1:14:11.42, ,,0,0,0,,- 个人最好吧 - 好吧 我要给你计时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It's a personal best. - Okay, then I wanna time you.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:11.80,1:14:16.05, ,,0,0,0,,给我计时? 开玩笑吧 我根本就没可能打破25.16秒的记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You wanna time me? You gotta be kidding. Because there is no possible way I can beat 25.16 seconds.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:16.26,1:14:21.31, ,,0,0,0,,- 鲸鱼在水下可以屏息多久? - 大约20分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- How long can a whale hold its breath under water? - A whale can hold its breath for about 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:21.35,1:14:23.60, ,,0,0,0,,- 那你可以打破鲸鱼的记录 - 嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Then you gotta beat the whale. - Okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:26.73,1:14:27.90, ,,0,0,0,,你可以打败鲸鱼...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You gotta beat the whale...
Dialogue: 1,1:14:29.69,1:14:30.57, ,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Here you go.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:31.32,1:14:32.15, ,,0,0,0,,会憋20分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That's gonna be 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:32.19,1:14:34.78, ,,0,0,0,,- 你确定不想去要点冰淇淋还是其他的? - 不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You sure you don't wanna go for a ice cream or something? - No.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:34.82,1:14:37.57, ,,0,0,0,,- 因为你知道...我会打败鲸鱼 - 是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- 'Cause you know...you know I'm gonna beat that whale. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:38.74,1:14:42.04, ,,0,0,0,,- 把表给我 给我 - 三 二 一...开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Give me the count... give me the count. - Three, two, one...go!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:00.39,1:15:01.68, ,,0,0,0,,肖恩?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sean?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:04.73,1:15:05.94, ,,0,0,0,,肖恩!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sean?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:08.86,1:15:10.07, ,,0,0,0,,肖恩?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sean!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:14.57,1:15:16.12, ,,0,0,0,,肖恩?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sean?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:16.66,1:15:17.66, ,,0,0,0,,你看到肖...?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Have you seen...?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:19.20,1:15:20.16, ,,0,0,0,,肖恩?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sean?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:20.29,1:15:21.58, ,,0,0,0,,我在找我的儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm looking for my son.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:21.75,1:15:23.62, ,,0,0,0,,你看见一个穿红泳裤的男孩了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Have you seen a boy in a red bathing suit?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:24.83,1:15:25.88, ,,0,0,0,,肖恩!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sean!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:26.38,1:15:28.04, ,,0,0,0,,你看见一个穿红泳裤的男孩了...?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Have you seen a little boy in a red...
Dialogue: 1,1:15:28.09,1:15:29.46, ,,0,0,0,,他穿着红色的泳裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's wearing a red bathing suit.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:30.34,1:15:31.88, ,,0,0,0,,肖恩!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sean!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:34.51,1:15:36.68, ,,0,0,0,,肖恩!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sean!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:17.86,1:17:18.99, ,,0,0,0,,贞德 我们已经就位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jad, we're now in position
Dialogue: 1,1:17:19.10,1:17:22.63, ,,0,0,0,,可以开始对 北鲍威尔地区的居民进行热能跟踪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}and ready to begin thermal scan on all residents on North Powell.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:23.92,1:17:26.05, ,,0,0,0,,弗雷彻 我觉得你肯定特别喜欢我 是吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm thinking you must really like me, don't you, Fletcher?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:26.38,1:17:29.07, ,,0,0,0,,这也是你要和我搭档这次突击的原因 是吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That's why you asked to partner with me on this little sortie, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:29.20,1:17:30.97, ,,0,0,0,,你是个自大的搭档 克洛特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I think you're swell company, Knott.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:31.01,1:17:33.09, ,,0,0,0,,我和领导独处时你不信任我 这没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's not at all that you don't trust me to be alone with the Chief.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:34.18,1:17:36.56, ,,0,0,0,,你觉得 有机会我也许会干他...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That you think I might, you know, fuck with him, if I had the chance...
Dialogue: 1,1:17:36.72,1:17:40.02, ,,0,0,0,,不杰夫 我就是想看看他拿你的身体撞墙会是什么样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No, I just wanna watch him use your body to sandblast another building. That's all. Jeff.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:40.89,1:17:42.02, ,,0,0,0,,艾瓦娜 行动!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Evanna, go!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:42.52,1:17:46.02, ,,0,0,0,,发现27处体热辐射\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I show twenty-seven warm bodies.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:46.19,1:17:48.40, ,,0,0,0,,收到 确定27处体热辐射\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Roger that. Confirm twenty-seven warm bodies.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:49.07,1:17:50.66, ,,0,0,0,,你觉得放4只蜘蛛如何? 一层一个?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What do you think four spyders? One per floor?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:50.99,1:17:53.12, ,,0,0,0,,放8只吧 我还得赶时间吃东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Let's do eight. I gotta eat.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:09.26,1:18:12.34, ,,0,0,0,,931大楼的居民 931大楼的居民\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Residents of 931 Powell. Residents of 931 Powell.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:12.39,1:18:14.39, ,,0,0,0,,我是特区犯罪预防官弗雷彻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is officer Fletcher D.C. Precrime.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:14.93,1:18:18.14, ,,0,0,0,,根据犯罪预警法第6409条规定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Under the authority of P.C. section six-four-zero-nine.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:18.18,1:18:20.52, ,,0,0,0,,我们在大楼里面安置了蜘蛛监视设备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We are deploying spyders into your complex.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:20.60,1:18:22.44, ,,0,0,0,,- 快点! - 妈妈 我好害怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Go, go, go, go. - Mummy, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:23.86,1:18:25.44, ,,0,0,0,,我害怕 妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Mummy, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:25.61,1:18:28.65, ,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 别怕 睁开眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Mummy. - Just scanning. Keep your eyes open, just open.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:28.86,1:18:31.11, ,,0,0,0,,不要乱跑 睁开眼睛 没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Stay still, baby. Open your eyes. It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:31.37,1:18:33.74, ,,0,0,0,,- 不用讨厌它 - 别乱跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I don't like it. - Stay still. Stay still.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:01.90,1:19:04.02, ,,0,0,0,,我告诉我在哪了 离我远点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I told you where I was. Get off my back!
Dialogue: 1,1:19:04.07,1:19:05.69, ,,0,0,0,,你是个笨人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You are no good liar.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:05.77,1:19:08.49, ,,0,0,0,,- 我知道你昨晚和谁在一起! - 你这个疯子...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I know you were with that ho last night! - You wacky wi...
Dialogue: 1,1:19:13.12,1:19:14.58, ,,0,0,0,,离我远点!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 1,1:20:31.53,1:20:32.54, ,,0,0,0,,失掉一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We lost one.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:33.37,1:20:34.41, ,,0,0,0,,收到!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Roger that!
Dialogue: 1,1:20:35.41,1:20:37.29, ,,0,0,0,,或者那仅仅是只猫跳过了窗户 或是什么其他的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Maybe it was a cat jumped trough a window, or something.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:37.83,1:20:39.25, ,,0,0,0,,真是只可怕的大猫...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's an awful big cat...
Dialogue: 1,1:20:39.46,1:20:40.42, ,,0,0,0,,弗雷彻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Fletcher.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:41.80,1:20:43.00, ,,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:22.26,1:21:26.66, ,,0,0,0,,哪有什么犯罪份子 你们在制造恐惧 绝对在制造恐惧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If there's a crime in the rise up. Your terrify. They're absolutely terrified right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:26.70,1:21:29.01, ,,0,0,0,,不想让你孩子受惊的话 离我远点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you don't want you kids to know terror keep them away from me.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:43.61,1:21:45.11, ,,0,0,0,,等等...大猫回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wait a minute...the big cat's back.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:45.99,1:21:47.74, ,,0,0,0,,你们觉得呢? 一个醉鬼 还醒不来?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What do you guys think, a drunk maybe, can't wake up?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:48.24,1:21:49.78, ,,0,0,0,,是啊 或者是某个家伙不想被检查罢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yeah. Or some guy who doesn't want to get read.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:50.58,1:21:53.25, ,,0,0,0,,居民们 保持安静关上门回到屋里去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Folks, please be quit. Close your doors get back inside.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:13.73,1:22:15.81, ,,0,0,0,,找到一个验证身份 不是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We got an ID. It's not him.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:17.77,1:22:20.23, ,,0,0,0,,- 收队 - 去吃东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Standing down. - Let's eat!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:34.00,1:22:35.92, ,,0,0,0,,弗雷彻 你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Fletcher! Take a look.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:38.67,1:22:42.46, ,,0,0,0,,- 房间里有4个人而不是3个 - 4个?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- There's four people in this room not three. - Four?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:43.09,1:22:45.47, ,,0,0,0,,安德顿 克鲁和一个戴墨镜的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There's Anderton, there's Crow and there's the man with the sunglasses.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:45.64,1:22:47.14, ,,0,0,0,,窗户外有个戴墨镜的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There's the man with the sunglasses outside the window.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:51.48,1:22:55.94, ,,0,0,0,,- 这里还有一个...在镜子里 - 对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- There's also someone here...in the mirror. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:56.69,1:22:57.81, ,,0,0,0,,是个女的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Definitely female.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:59.11,1:23:03.24, ,,0,0,0,,在联邦同意下 犯罪预防系统于2046年启动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The Precrime program began in the year 2046, with a Federal grant.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:03.57,1:23:08.41, ,,0,0,0,,9年后的现在 哥伦比亚特区成为美国最安全的城市\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And now, nine years later, the District of Columbia is the safest city in America.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:08.91,1:23:11.20, ,,0,0,0,,什么原因呢? 因为犯罪预防系统很有效果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why? Because Precrime works.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:11.75,1:23:14.79, ,,0,0,0,,犯罪预防系统无须惯常的侦破工作...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Precrime has eliminated the need for conventional detectives,
Dialogue: 1,1:23:15.29,1:23:16.63, ,,0,0,0,,...所以大多现在发生的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...so most of what happens now,
Dialogue: 1,1:23:16.96,1:23:21.30, ,,0,0,0,,- 只是对未来受害人的保护和确认 - 那我们可以见见预测师吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- is the verification and the protection of the future victim... - Can we see the Precogs?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:21.55,1:23:24.01, ,,0,0,0,,嗯 预测师拥有如此强大的天赋...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Well the Precogs have such a powerful gift,
Dialogue: 1,1:23:24.34,1:23:28.39, ,,0,0,0,,... 他们需被隔离在平和的环境下 不受外界的干扰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}..that they have to be kept in peaceful seclusion so as not to be distracted from the outside world.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:28.64,1:23:32.02, ,,0,0,0,,这次参观将让你们了解 一些他们的日常生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But this display should give you some idea of what their daily life is like.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:34.48,1:23:37.90, ,,0,0,0,,预测师们一年会收到800万封邮件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The Precogs get over eight million pieces of mail every year.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:38.36,1:23:39.78, ,,0,0,0,,比圣诞老人收到的还多...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}More mail than Santa Claus gets...
Dialogue: 1,1:23:39.90,1:23:42.99, ,,0,0,0,,每个预测师都有自己单独的卧室 电视和会客厅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Each Precog has their own bedroom, television and wait room.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:43.49,1:23:45.95, ,,0,0,0,,成为预测师是一件很奇妙的事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It really is wonderful to be a Precog.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:11.27,1:24:13.14, ,,0,0,0,,妈妈的新凯子昨晚又来了...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Mom's new boyfriend came over again last night,
Dialogue: 1,1:24:13.19,1:24:15.86, ,,0,0,0,,...而且那不是个很聪明的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...and he is not very intelligent person.
Dialogue: 1,1:24:15.90,1:24:18.19, ,,0,0,0,,我妈会不让我到楼上吃东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}My mom wouldn't let me go upstairs eat in my room,
Dialogue: 1,1:24:18.23,1:24:22.20, ,,0,0,0,,她会让我坐下来听那个人喋喋不休的一直说...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}..so she let me sit down there the entire time having to listen to him go on and on and on...
Dialogue: 1,1:24:30.96,1:24:32.41, ,,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:32.46,1:24:34.08, ,,0,0,0,,真该死!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Shit! Shit! Shit! Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:50.85,1:24:53.69, ,,0,0,0,,"身份确认 约翰·安德顿准许进入"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Ident. John Anderton approved for entry."
Dialogue: 1,1:25:09.12,1:25:11.29, ,,0,0,0,,不不不... 你不能在此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No no no no... You can't be in here.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:11.71,1:25:13.04, ,,0,0,0,,不不不...你在这干吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No no no...what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:17.13,1:25:19.97, ,,0,0,0,,不不不...别弄坏了那个计时器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No no no no...Easy there old timer who cleared you?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:20.26,1:25:21.80, ,,0,0,0,,- 你不该来此 - 听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You're not supposed to be in here. - Listen Wally.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:21.84,1:25:23.22, ,,0,0,0,,我认识你吗? 你是谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Do I know you? Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:23.39,1:25:27.18, ,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你 威尼 所以我不会扁你 或者拿什么硬物砸你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I like you, Wally, so I don't wanna have to kick you, or hit you with anything hard.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:27.39,1:25:28.85, ,,0,0,0,,但是你必须答应帮我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But only if your promise to help me.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:31.14,1:25:32.15, ,,0,0,0,,哦 嘿 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, hi, John!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:41.53,1:25:42.66, ,,0,0,0,,你认得他吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What does that look like to you?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:45.24,1:25:46.62, ,,0,0,0,,不认识\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:50.87,1:25:52.08, ,,0,0,0,,是阿加沙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's Agatha.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:53.00,1:25:54.42, ,,0,0,0,,他来救她了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's coming here to get her.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:57.30,1:25:58.67, ,,0,0,0,,这就是她的所谓的预知?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Are these all of her previsions?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:59.38,1:26:00.51, ,,0,0,0,,我马上让她预测\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm winding her right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:03.64,1:26:06.06, ,,0,0,0,,我不需要了解这些 直接带我到 去见杀人犯尼奥·克鲁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't need to see all this, just take me to the Leo Crow murder.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:06.10,1:26:08.85, ,,0,0,0,,我在查找 不会那么快的 我想知道她会给我看什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm looking. It's not coming up in any order. I'm getting what she's giving.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:13.48,1:26:14.69, ,,0,0,0,,看到了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can you see?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:28.83,1:26:30.75, ,,0,0,0,,- 他在里面 - 他戴了某种面具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He's inside. - He's got some kind of mask on.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:31.42,1:26:33.34, ,,0,0,0,,- 他从里面封住了门 - 该死!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He sealed the doors from the inside. - Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:26:33.79,1:26:37.01, ,,0,0,0,,任何人不要在神殿里面开火 只准用黏液枪或者是警棍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Nobody fires a weapon inside the temple. Use only binds foam or your sick-sticks.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:37.05,1:26:38.01, ,,0,0,0,,这里还有其他的出路吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Is there another way out of there?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:38.05,1:26:39.84, ,,0,0,0,,我们已经包围了所有的门 他出不来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We got all the doors covered, there is no way he's getting out.
Dialogue: 1,1:26:40.09,1:26:42.43, ,,0,0,0,,约翰 出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John! Move away from the tank!
Dialogue: 1,1:26:43.10,1:26:45.01, ,,0,0,0,,出来 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Move away from the tank, John!
Dialogue: 1,1:26:54.11,1:26:56.57, ,,0,0,0,,不不不...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No no no...
Dialogue: 1,1:27:03.58,1:27:05.62, ,,0,0,0,,- 他要预测师干吗? - 你认为呢 先生?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What does he want with a Precog? - What do you think, sir?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:05.66,1:27:08.66, ,,0,0,0,,没有人预测他就能够 杀死任何他想杀的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He can kill whoever he wants to without anyone knowing about it.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:08.92,1:27:10.00, ,,0,0,0,,但是还有其他两个预测师啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But there's still the other two.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:11.08,1:27:13.97, ,,0,0,0,,威尼...威尼 其他两个预测师还能起作用 是吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wally...Wally! The other two can still function, right?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:14.00,1:27:16.17, ,,0,0,0,,你不明白...他们是共同思想的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You don't understand... they're are hive minded.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:16.21,1:27:19.34, ,,0,0,0,,三个在一起才有预知未来的能力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It takes all three for their predictive abilities to work.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:22.93,1:27:23.93, ,,0,0,0,,你是说他们再也不能预知犯罪了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Are you telling me they can't see murders anymore?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:24.03,1:27:25.23, ,,0,0,0,,如果他抢走的是一个男预测师可能还能预测\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Maybe if he's taken one of the males..
Dialogue: 1,1:27:25.30,1:27:26.93, ,,0,0,0,,可偏偏是阿加沙 她是关键人物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But Agatha, she's the key.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:27.85,1:27:30.60, ,,0,0,0,,其他人都听她的 她最具有智慧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She's the one they listen to, the one with the most talent.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:30.86,1:27:32.11, ,,0,0,0,,而且是她照顾其他两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She takes care of the other two.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:32.73,1:27:33.40, ,,0,0,0,,天啦...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jesus...
Dialogue: 1,1:27:34.90,1:27:35.74, ,,0,0,0,,拜托 找回她...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Please, bring her back. Plea...
Dialogue: 1,1:27:35.78,1:27:38.99, ,,0,0,0,,找出那管道通向哪里 呼叫所有在地下的小队\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Find out where that pipe leads I want every team underground now!
Dialogue: 1,1:27:39.24,1:27:39.99, ,,0,0,0,,不重要 他赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It doesn's matter. He wins.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:40.00,1:27:42.03, ,,0,0,0,,不不 我会派些人到舱外 会在蓄水池那抓住他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No no, I'll send some men at the EVA we'll stop him at the reservoir.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:42.03,1:27:44.04, ,,0,0,0,,戈登 他杀克鲁时她也在场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Gordon, she's in the room with him when he kills Crow.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:45.00,1:27:46.37, ,,0,0,0,,她已经属于他未来的一部分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She's already a part of his future.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:47.21,1:27:49.88, ,,0,0,0,,杰德 尽一切可能找出犯罪地点 我们要阻止这次谋杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jad, put everything you're got into finding that room and we stop a murder.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:50.75,1:27:51.88, ,,0,0,0,,戈登 我们还有多少时间?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How much time have we got, Gordon?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:52.13,1:27:53.13, ,,0,0,0,,还有...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We've got...
Dialogue: 1,1:27:54.34,1:27:56.38, ,,0,0,0,,51分30秒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}51 minutes 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:58.84,1:27:59.89, ,,0,0,0,,你冷吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You cold?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:00.76,1:28:01.89, ,,0,0,0,,明白我说什么吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can you understand me?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:02.43,1:28:03.43, ,,0,0,0,,你冷吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Are you cold?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:04.10,1:28:05.85, ,,0,0,0,,我让你害怕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The shivers are the drugs we gave you.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:06.85,1:28:07.85, ,,0,0,0,,很快就会过去的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It will wear of soon.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:09.31,1:28:10.90, ,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我需要你的帮助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm sorry. I need your help.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:11.06,1:28:13.98, ,,0,0,0,,你有一些我想要的信息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You contain information. I need to know how to get it.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:15.61,1:28:19.70, ,,0,0,0,,- 能告诉我里奥·克罗是谁吗? 能告诉我吗... - 现在?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Can you just tell me who Leo Crow is? Can you tell me if... - Is it now?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:19.82,1:28:21.70, ,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 是现在吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- What? - Is it now?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:24.29,1:28:26.66, ,,0,0,0,,是的 最好马上告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yes... this is all happening right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:28.79,1:28:32.92, ,,0,0,0,,我带你去一处公共场所 那样我得给你换点别的衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I gotta take you someplace in public, which means I gotta get you something else to wear.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:33.46,1:28:37.01, ,,0,0,0,,我已经...已经厌倦了将来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm tired...I'm tired of the future.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:44.02,1:28:46.77, ,,0,0,0,,"你好 雅克马托先生 欢迎再次光临"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Hello, Mr. Yakamoto! Welcome back to the Gap."
Dialogue: 1,1:28:46.89,1:28:49.10, ,,0,0,0,,"上次为您量身打造的衣服怎么样啊? "\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"How's those assorted tank tops work out for you?"
Dialogue: 1,1:28:50.82,1:28:52.36, ,,0,0,0,,雅克马托先生?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Mr. Yakamoto?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:16.55,1:29:18.85, ,,0,0,0,,如果他想敲诈她 那该死的勒索信呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If he's ransoming her, where's the damn note?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:19.01,1:29:20.39, ,,0,0,0,,跟勒索没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It has nothing to do with ransom.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:21.06,1:29:23.68, ,,0,0,0,,他需要阿加沙掌握的信息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It has to do with the information that's inside of Agatha.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:26.00,1:29:27.35, ,,0,0,0,,他试图证明他的清白\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's trying to prove his innocence. 
Dialogue: 1,1:29:27.65,1:29:30.15, ,,0,0,0,,没有大量的技术支持 他没法下载她的有用信息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He can't download her without a lot of technical support.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:30.52,1:29:32.90, ,,0,0,0,,嗯 普通消费者是买不到这些技术的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, well. Your average consumer can't buy any of this stuff.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:33.28,1:29:36.99, ,,0,0,0,,随便买卖这些技术是要进监牢的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Because of it's been assembled and scrounged from spare parts made to warden.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:39.70,1:29:41.95, ,,0,0,0,,傲慢的安德顿要求如此 但谁会理会?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Assuming Anderton ordered this, who put it together?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:52.42,1:29:54.92, ,,0,0,0,,鲁福斯·T·瑞内是谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Who's Rufus T. Riley?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:57.72,1:29:59.30, ,,0,0,0,,你喜欢什么? 我们这什么都有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What's you pleasure? We got it all here.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:59.35,1:30:03.18, ,,0,0,0,,我们可以让你的运动梦想成真 还可以让你飞翔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We got sports fantasies. We got what I like to call "Look Ma, I can fly" fantasies...
Dialogue: 1,1:30:03.23,1:30:07.15, ,,0,0,0,,包括从蹦极到如雄鹰翱翔于大峡谷的一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...which encompass everything from bungee jumping to soaring like an eagle over the Grand Canyon.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:07.44,1:30:09.52, ,,0,0,0,,我们可以让一个男人像女人那样享受性爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We got guys come in, want to experience sex as a woman.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:09.57,1:30:12.36, ,,0,0,0,,我们可以让女人和她所钟爱的 肥皂剧影星做爱 或者是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We got women come in, want to get laid by their favourite soap stars. Or...
Dialogue: 1,1:30:13.78,1:30:15.70, ,,0,0,0,,这里有无穷的乐趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Here's some good clean fun.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:19.49,1:30:22.45, ,,0,0,0,,这种感觉很刺激 但是又不会让您心脏病发作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's a big rush, but you come out the other side without a heart attack.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:22.58,1:30:24.50, ,,0,0,0,,我想杀了我的老板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I wanna kill my boss.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:25.67,1:30:28.00, ,,0,0,0,,啊哈 可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Uh-huh. Okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:28.84,1:30:30.34, ,,0,0,0,,有什么梦想我可以帮你实现吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You got some images I can work with?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:30.96,1:30:31.71, ,,0,0,0,,鲁福斯...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Rufus...
Dialogue: 1,1:30:33.17,1:30:35.76, ,,0,0,0,,成为费城交响乐团的指挥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Uh, yeah, being concert master of the Philadelphia Symphony..
Dialogue: 1,1:30:35.77,1:30:37.76, ,,0,0,0,,是我们最流行的选择之一...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Orchestra is one of our most popular choices...
Dialogue: 1,1:30:37.80,1:30:39.35, ,,0,0,0,,不 我要杀了我的老板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No, I wanna kill my boss!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:39.85,1:30:44.27, ,,0,0,0,,你这个变态 就是你这样的人 把我们的世界搞得一团糟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You sick bastard. You're the kind of person that makes this a terrible world to live in!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:44.60,1:30:48.32, ,,0,0,0,,侦探 感谢大驾光临 现在好像全世界的条子都在找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Detective. Nice of you to come down here. Seeing as every cop in the world is looking for you right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:48.36,1:30:49.48, ,,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I need your help.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:49.82,1:30:53.07, ,,0,0,0,,为什么你老是抱着某种目的来这呢? 长官 我是可以打电话报警的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why did you come all the way down here for. Chief, I make house calls you know that.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:53.32,1:30:56.45, ,,0,0,0,,- 我和她需要帮助 - 哦 你好 宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I need help with her. - Well, hello there, honey-pie.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:57.20,1:31:01.04, ,,0,0,0,,我很惊讶 安德顿 你在潜逃 但你仍然有时间和精力给自己...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm impressed, Anderton. You're on the lam, but you still got the time and energy to slice off a little...
Dialogue: 1,1:31:01.83,1:31:03.16, ,,0,0,0,,...找乐子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...jerky for yourself.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:03.33,1:31:07.75, ,,0,0,0,,- 她是个预言师 - 哦 是吗 预言师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- She's a Precog. - Oh...yeah...okay...she's a Precog.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:10.80,1:31:13.51, ,,0,0,0,,你带来了个预言师?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You brought a Precog...here?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:28.19,1:31:29.40, ,,0,0,0,,老天...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jesus Christ...
Dialogue: 1,1:31:30.94,1:31:33.32, ,,0,0,0,,- 你现在在感知我的意识吗? - 站起来!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Are you reading my mind right now? - Get up!
Dialogue: 1,1:31:33.91,1:31:37.62, ,,0,0,0,,我忏悔我做的一切 我发誓 我从没做过我做过的事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'msorry for whatever I'm gonna do! And I swear, I didn't do any of the stuff I did!
Dialogue: 1,1:31:42.00,1:31:45.29, ,,0,0,0,,她带有一些信息 我要你把那些信息弄出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She's got information inside of her. I need you to get it out.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:45.63,1:31:47.92, ,,0,0,0,,没门 哥们 我根本就不知道从哪开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No way, man. No. I wouldn'd even know where to begin!
Dialogue: 1,1:31:49.05,1:31:51.97, ,,0,0,0,,那些关于我堂妹艾琳拉的想法 那仅仅是想法而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Those thoughts about my cousin Elena, they were just thoughts.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:52.88,1:31:55.01, ,,0,0,0,,- 你已经两次因为犯黑客罪而被降级 - 所以呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You're been busted twice for felony hacking. - So?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:55.05,1:31:56.64, ,,0,0,0,,所以现在我需要你入侵她的意识\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So now I need you to hack into her.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:01.02,1:32:05.81, ,,0,0,0,,我跟你说 这样做我就得保留所有 从她大脑里面得到得信息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I tell you what. I do this, I get to keep whatever images I get from her head.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:06.44,1:32:07.52, ,,0,0,0,,那些信息不属于任何人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They don't belong to anybody.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:08.15,1:32:09.82, ,,0,0,0,,带她去沙克电台吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Then take her to Radio Shack.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:11.86,1:32:13.32, ,,0,0,0,,鲁福斯 你得帮我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Rufus, you gotta help me.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:19.50,1:32:20.83, ,,0,0,0,,阿加沙 我要知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Agatha I need to see.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:21.29,1:32:23.04, ,,0,0,0,,我要知道我会遇上什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I need to see what's gonna happen to me.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:25.34,1:32:27.17, ,,0,0,0,,而那样我就可以采取措施了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And then we'll go.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:40.94,1:32:44.15, ,,0,0,0,,- 哇 起作用了 - 慢点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Wow. She works. - Slow it down.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:45.94,1:32:48.28, ,,0,0,0,,我怎么慢点 砸她的头?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How do I slow this down? I should hit her on the head?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:55.41,1:32:57.28, ,,0,0,0,,- 你录下来了吗? - 该死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Are you recording this? - Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:58.95,1:33:00.12, ,,0,0,0,,好 开始录了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yeah, recording.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:27.36,1:33:29.40, ,,0,0,0,,这些我已经知道了 再快点 快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I know this already. Come on. Move on.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:33.16,1:33:34.41, ,,0,0,0,,再见 克鲁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Good-bye, Crow.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:45.34,1:33:46.05, ,,0,0,0,,怎么啦?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What happened?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:46.92,1:33:48.71, ,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 怎么回事?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I don't know. - What happened?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:49.72,1:33:51.88, ,,0,0,0,,- 剩下的呢? - 我猜就这么点了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Where's the rest of it? - I guess that's all of it.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:54.39,1:33:57.31, ,,0,0,0,,我的少数派报告呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Where is my Minority Report?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:59.81,1:34:01.44, ,,0,0,0,,我肯定有一个的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Do I even have one?!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:06.94,1:34:08.03, ,,0,0,0,,我有吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Do I have one?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:08.78,1:34:09.95, ,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:11.74,1:34:14.28, ,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- What? - No.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:22.08,1:34:23.42, ,,0,0,0,,怎么了...怎么了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What...what?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:23.75,1:34:25.55, ,,0,0,0,,阿加沙 怎么了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Agatha. What?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:27.09,1:34:29.17, ,,0,0,0,,- 看到了吗? - 看到什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Can you see? - See what?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:46.03,1:34:47.11, ,,0,0,0,,安妮·莱夫丽...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anne Lively...
Dialogue: 1,1:34:56.00,1:34:58.00, ,,0,0,0,,你想让我知道谁杀了安妮·莱夫丽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You want me to see who killed Anne Lively.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:59.21,1:35:02.17, ,,0,0,0,,- 你录了吧? - 是的 但是看上去像是回放\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Are you recording this? - Yeah, but look it's backwards.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:08.84,1:35:11.09, ,,0,0,0,,我热爱我的生命 一切都是美好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I like my life. Everything is good.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:22.65,1:35:25.73, ,,0,0,0,,- 他们来了 - 谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- They're inside. - Who?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:27.57,1:35:28.78, ,,0,0,0,,全是你的老队友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All your old team mates.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:30.74,1:35:31.87, ,,0,0,0,,- 查看房间 - 好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Chamber. Look in chamber. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:33.45,1:35:34.20, ,,0,0,0,,不是!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Negative!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:35.79,1:35:36.54, ,,0,0,0,,不是!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Negative!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:37.41,1:35:38.16, ,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:38.58,1:35:40.54, ,,0,0,0,,- 你是那个人 - 不不 你是那个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You are the man! - No, no, you're the man!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:48.30,1:35:49.55, ,,0,0,0,,你看到那些伞了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can you see the umbrella?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:51.05,1:35:53.60, ,,0,0,0,,拿一把 拿一把\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Take it. Take it!
Dialogue: 1,1:35:58.81,1:36:00.06, ,,0,0,0,,那个穿蓝外套的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The man in the blue suit.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:00.98,1:36:02.44, ,,0,0,0,,他丢了他的公文包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He drops his briefcase.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:10.62,1:36:12.37, ,,0,0,0,,你看一个女人穿着褐色大衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You see a woman in a brown dress.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:13.04,1:36:14.41, ,,0,0,0,,她认识你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She knows you face.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:15.87,1:36:16.91, ,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Turn in here.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:24.42,1:36:25.30, ,,0,0,0,,走吧!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,1:36:31.56,1:36:33.52, ,,0,0,0,,- 停! - 我们不能在这里逗留\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Wait! - No. We can't stop here!
Dialogue: 1,1:36:33.56,1:36:34.64, ,,0,0,0,,看见那个卖气球的男人了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can you see the balloon man?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:38.02,1:36:39.23, ,,0,0,0,,等等...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wait...
Dialogue: 1,1:36:42.19,1:36:43.32, ,,0,0,0,,等等..\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wait...
Dialogue: 1,1:36:44.86,1:36:45.94, ,,0,0,0,,等什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:51.12,1:36:52.99, ,,0,0,0,,等等...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wait...wait...
Dialogue: 1,1:36:53.70,1:36:54.75, ,,0,0,0,,等等...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wait...
Dialogue: 1,1:36:55.66,1:36:57.87, ,,0,0,0,,- 求求你了 妈妈 给我买一个 - 嗯 好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Please, mummy, can we have one? - Well, alright.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:01.42,1:37:02.59, ,,0,0,0,,等着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wait.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:07.55,1:37:08.84, ,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:09.93,1:37:12.56, ,,0,0,0,,- 有人发现目标了吗? - 没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Anybody get an ID? Anybody? - Negative.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:13.27,1:37:16.81, ,,0,0,0,,好吧 斯考特 雷蒙思 去查查那边 其他人跟我来 行动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Alright. Scott. Ramos. Take these dens there. Everyone else follow me. Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:29.49,1:37:31.33, ,,0,0,0,,他知道 别回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He knows. Don't go home.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:40.67,1:37:41.88, ,,0,0,0,,我们已经盯上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We've got eyes on.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:44.80,1:37:48.84, ,,0,0,0,,- 等等 赏点小钱儿吧? - 给他点钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Hold. Please, please have you got a coin? - Drop some money.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:52.35,1:37:54.39, ,,0,0,0,,你就不能放到我手里来?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can't you put it in my hand?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:55.48,1:37:58.48, ,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑你!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}May God Bless You!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:21.63,1:38:22.59, ,,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Damn!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:51.62,1:38:52.58, ,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That's the guy!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:53.87,1:38:55.08, ,,0,0,0,,窗户上映出来的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The man in the window.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:08.31,1:39:10.68, ,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:11.64,1:39:14.14, ,,0,0,0,,- 一间房加税是95美元一晚 - 介意我看看你的执照吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Rooms are ninety-five a night plus tax. - You mind if I take a look at your register?
Dialogue: 1,1:39:14.81,1:39:16.27, ,,0,0,0,,是啊 我介意...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yeah, I mind...
Dialogue: 1,1:39:17.73,1:39:18.69, ,,0,0,0,,那现在呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How about now?
Dialogue: 1,1:39:19.23,1:39:20.32, ,,0,0,0,,您自己看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Help yourself.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:34.75,1:39:35.83, ,,0,0,0,,他在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's here.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:36.75,1:39:38.13, ,,0,0,0,,安德顿 快走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anderton, leave.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:45.76,1:39:48.97, ,,0,0,0,,你有得选择 快走 就是现在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You have a choice. Walk away. Right now.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:49.10,1:39:51.93, ,,0,0,0,,不行 我得知道我的生活出了什么问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I can't. I have to know. I have to find out what happened to my life.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:51.98,1:39:53.23, ,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Please.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:54.02,1:39:57.98, ,,0,0,0,,阿加沙 我不会杀死那个男人的 我甚至不认识他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Agatha. I'm not going to kill the man. I don't even know him.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:58.19,1:40:00.03, ,,0,0,0,,- 克罗在哪个房间? - 1006.\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- What room is Crow in? - 1006.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:01.53,1:40:02.15, ,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Come on.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:03.32,1:40:04.07, ,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Come on.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:23.78,1:41:24.57, ,,0,0,0,,错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wrong room.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:54.23,1:41:55.23, ,,0,0,0,,离开这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Leave.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:56.36,1:41:57.32, ,,0,0,0,,离开这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Leave!
Dialogue: 1,1:42:54.34,1:42:55.46, ,,0,0,0,,噢 上帝...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, God...
Dialogue: 1,1:43:00.80,1:43:03.68, ,,0,0,0,,是肖恩 我的儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is Sean. My son.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:08.48,1:43:13.11, ,,0,0,0,,这6年里每一天我都想着两件事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Every day for the last six years I've thought about only two things.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:15.57,1:43:18.74, ,,0,0,0,,第一件是如果我的儿子活着的话 现在会长成什么样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The first was what my son would look like if he were alive today.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:20.95,1:43:23.66, ,,0,0,0,,如果我在大街上碰到他 我是否还认得出他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If I would even recognize him if I saw him on the street.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:28.37,1:43:30.83, ,,0,0,0,,第二件事是我该如何处置 那个带走我儿子的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The second was what I would do to the man who took him.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:36.97,1:43:38.01, ,,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You were right.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:40.05,1:43:41.39, ,,0,0,0,,我没有被陷害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm not being set up.
Dialogue: 1,1:43:44.39,1:43:46.06, ,,0,0,0,,你必须带我回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You have to take me home!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:52.82,1:43:58.90, ,,0,0,0,,正如你所说的 没有少数派报告 我也没有可以选择的未来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You said so yourself, there is no Minority Report. I don't have an alternate future.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:00.95,1:44:02.70, ,,0,0,0,,我要杀了这个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I am going to kill this man.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:05.91,1:44:07.50, ,,0,0,0,,你仍然有得选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You still have a choice.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:08.46,1:44:12.34, ,,0,0,0,,其他人看不到他们的未来 你还有得选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The others never saw their future. You still have a choice!
Dialogue: 1,1:44:14.51,1:44:15.30, ,,0,0,0,,里奥·克罗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Leo Crow?
Dialogue: 1,1:44:16.01,1:44:17.01, ,,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 1,1:44:23.01,1:44:26.89, ,,0,0,0,,6年前 巴尔的摩市 你在 西伦敦富兰克公众泳池抢走一个孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Six years ago. Baltimore. You grabbed a kid at Francis public pool in the West End.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:28.73,1:44:32.27, ,,0,0,0,,我有吗? ...我不知道 我不知道什么公众场所...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Did I? I don't know... I don't know a thing about a public place...
Dialogue: 1,1:44:37.28,1:44:39.11, ,,0,0,0,,我是谁? ! 我是谁? !\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Who am I?! Who am I?!
Dialogue: 1,1:44:40.99,1:44:41.95, ,,0,0,0,,你是某人的父亲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're someone's father.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:42.24,1:44:43.95, ,,0,0,0,,他的名字叫肖恩!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}His name is Sean!
Dialogue: 1,1:44:48.75,1:44:50.25, ,,0,0,0,,我跟他说我是个警察...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I told him I was a policeman...
Dialogue: 1,1:44:50.29,1:44:52.25, ,,0,0,0,,我跟他说需要他的帮助 这个谎言不错吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I told him I needed his help. Wasn't so bad.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:52.59,1:44:55.84, ,,0,0,0,,我给他唱歌听 还给他饼干吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I sang him a song and bought him a pretzel. I bought him a pretzel.
Dialogue: 1,1:44:56.97,1:44:58.84, ,,0,0,0,,他很开心!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He was happy! He was happy!
Dialogue: 1,1:44:59.60,1:45:00.80, ,,0,0,0,,他还活着吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Is he still alive?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:01.14,1:45:02.14, ,,0,0,0,,还活着吗? !\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Is he alive?!
Dialogue: 1,1:45:02.18,1:45:03.64, ,,0,0,0,,你把他藏哪了? 他还好吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Where have you got him? Is he all right?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:04.39,1:45:06.14, ,,0,0,0,,告诉我 你这个混蛋...他在哪? !\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Tell me, you fuck...where is he?!
Dialogue: 1,1:45:06.19,1:45:09.02, ,,0,0,0,,我把他装到一个桶里 然后丢到海湾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I put him in a barrel. I sunk him in the bay.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:10.31,1:45:13.40, ,,0,0,0,,但那个桶又漂回来 于是我就把他弄出来了... \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It floated back up. I took him out...
Dialogue: 1,1:45:13.51,1:45:15.90, ,,0,0,0,, 我很小心的...很温柔的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10} I was gentle...I was gentle...
Dialogue: 1,1:45:18.03,1:45:18.91, ,,0,0,0,,我很温柔的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I was gentle.
Dialogue: 1,1:45:24.71,1:45:27.21, ,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 抱歉...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm sorry! I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 1,1:45:30.34,1:45:32.34, ,,0,0,0,,十分的抱歉...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm so very sorry...
Dialogue: 1,1:45:35.72,1:45:37.18, ,,0,0,0,,干吗要那样对我?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why did you do that to me?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:09.79,1:46:11.09, ,,0,0,0,,你可以选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You can choose.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:15.76,1:46:17.55, ,,0,0,0,,你可以选择...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You can choose...
Dialogue: 1,1:46:36.41,1:46:37.62, ,,0,0,0,,你有权保持沉默\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:39.16,1:46:42.83, ,,0,0,0,,但你所说的每一句话都将作为呈堂证供\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anything you say or do can be used against you in a court of law.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:44.54,1:46:50.63, ,,0,0,0,,未来的任何审判你都有权请律师为你辩护\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You have the right to an attorney now, and during any further questioning.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:51.55,1:46:53.67, ,,0,0,0,,如果你不能负担一个律师的费用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you can't afford an attorney,
Dialogue: 1,1:46:56.84,1:46:58.39, ,,0,0,0,,我们将为你指派一位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...we will appoint one.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:00.56,1:47:02.35, ,,0,0,0,,你明白这些权利吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Do you understand these rights?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:04.23,1:47:05.65, ,,0,0,0,,你不杀我了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're not gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:09.61,1:47:11.74, ,,0,0,0,,- 你清楚这些... - 你不杀我了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You understand these... - You're not gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:11.94,1:47:13.40, ,,0,0,0,,...权利?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...rights?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:16.57,1:47:18.45, ,,0,0,0,,如果你不杀我 我的家人将什么也得不到!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you don't go through with this my family gets nothing!
Dialogue: 1,1:47:19.20,1:47:20.41, ,,0,0,0,,知道吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:20.45,1:47:26.88, ,,0,0,0,,- 你该杀了我 他说你会的 - 他?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You're supposed to kill me. He said you would. - He?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:27.50,1:47:28.21, ,,0,0,0,,"他"是谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Who's he?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:28.84,1:47:29.42, ,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:30.05,1:47:31.34, ,,0,0,0,,他打电话到我的囚室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He called me in my cell.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:32.09,1:47:36.05, ,,0,0,0,,他说我会被释放 如果我死了 我的家人将会得到很好的照顾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He told me I would be released, if I went along, and my family would be taken care of.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:36.22,1:47:38.89, ,,0,0,0,,如果什么? 如果你怎么样?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you what? If you did what?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:41.14,1:47:42.93, ,,0,0,0,,如果我做得像是我杀了你的儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If I acted like I killed your kid.
Dialogue: 1,1:47:43.73,1:47:44.48, ,,0,0,0,,行了吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:46.44,1:47:47.77, ,,0,0,0,,如果你杀了我的儿子? !\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you killed my kid?!
Dialogue: 1,1:47:48.69,1:47:52.15, ,,0,0,0,,听着 你不杀我 我的家人就什么也得不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Look, you don't kill me, my family gets nothing. Okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:53.15,1:47:54.28, ,,0,0,0,,那这照片是怎么回事?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What about the pictures?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:56.12,1:48:00.12, ,,0,0,0,,那是假的 他给我的 明白了吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They're fake. He gave them to me. Okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:00.45,1:48:06.29, ,,0,0,0,,听着 你得告诉那是谁? 谁安排的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Listen to me. Listen to me. You tell me who was it, set this up?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:07.42,1:48:08.25, ,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:09.96,1:48:12.80, ,,0,0,0,,快说 我再问你一遍 谁派你来的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Come on! - I'm asking you again. Who was who put you up?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:12.97,1:48:14.68, ,,0,0,0,,我没看到他的脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I didn't see his face.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:15.18,1:48:18.06, ,,0,0,0,,- 我要是告诉你了我的家人就什么都得不到 - 谁让干的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I tell you who it was and my family gets nothing. - Who made you do this?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:18.89,1:48:21.56, ,,0,0,0,,- 杀了我! - 快说!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Kill me! - Tell me!
Dialogue: 1,1:48:21.89,1:48:24.02, ,,0,0,0,,里奥 松开枪 松开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Let go of the gun. Leo, let go of the gun.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:25.56,1:48:27.73, ,,0,0,0,,松开枪 没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Let go of the gun. It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:30.07,1:48:31.65, ,,0,0,0,,松开枪 那才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Let go of the gun. That's it.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:32.28,1:48:33.28, ,,0,0,0,,松开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Let go of the gun.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:35.49,1:48:36.83, ,,0,0,0,,你不杀我...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're not gonna kill me...
Dialogue: 1,1:48:38.24,1:48:39.04, ,,0,0,0,,再见 克罗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Good-bye, Crow.
Dialogue: 1,1:48:39.37,1:48:40.66, ,,0,0,0,,安德顿 等等!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anderton! Wait a second!
Dialogue: 1,1:49:06.19,1:49:07.15, ,,0,0,0,,这没意义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:07.82,1:49:09.53, ,,0,0,0,,如果你是个儿童杀手 拍了这些照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you were a child killer, you took these pictures,
Dialogue: 1,1:49:09.90,1:49:11.82, ,,0,0,0,,你会把它们扔在床上让人发现吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...would you leave them on the bed for anyone to find?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:11.86,1:49:13.78, ,,0,0,0,,这些照片可能已经被收好了 只不过可能是安德顿找出来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They may have been put away, Anderton might have found them.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:14.03,1:49:15.37, ,,0,0,0,,在此之前你是什么类型的警察?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What kind of cop were you before this?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:15.41,1:49:16.91, ,,0,0,0,,经济犯罪部 干了8年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Treasury Agent, eight years.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:16.99,1:49:18.83, ,,0,0,0,,- 这是你第一次来到谋杀现场吧 - 是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- This would be your first actual murder scene. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:18.87,1:49:20.54, ,,0,0,0,,在调去联邦之前我是专管杀人案的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I worked homicide before I went federal.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:21.21,1:49:22.75, ,,0,0,0,,这就是我们所说的"明显的证据"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is what we would we call an "orgy of evidence".
Dialogue: 1,1:49:23.79,1:49:26.63, ,,0,0,0,,- 你知道杀人案有多少明显的证据吗? - 多少?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You know how many orgies I had as a homicide cop, Gordon? - How many?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:28.01,1:49:28.71, ,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}None.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:34.47,1:49:35.30, ,,0,0,0,,这是蓄意谋杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This was all arranged.
Dialogue: 1,1:49:36.60,1:49:40.81, ,,0,0,0,,今天我们看到了 自犯罪预防试验开始后6年的第一宗谋杀案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Today we saw the first murder in the six years of the Precrime experiment."
Dialogue: 1,1:49:41.52,1:49:44.15, ,,0,0,0,,"这是人类悲惨的失败"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"Sadly enough this failure was human."
Dialogue: 1,1:49:44.48,1:49:47.78, ,,0,0,0,,"保护小组没有及时阻止这宗谋杀"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"The protection team simply didn't get their in time, to stop the murder."
Dialogue: 1,1:49:48.11,1:49:52.66, ,,0,0,0,,"但是这宗谋杀跟预言师预测的一样"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"But the murder itself happened exactly as the Precogs predicted it would."
Dialogue: 1,1:49:53.32,1:49:57.08, ,,0,0,0,,"我认为今天的人类过于依赖犯罪预警系统了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"I think that today is bank on the human face on the Precrime system."
Dialogue: 1,1:49:57.12,1:49:59.58, ,,0,0,0,,- 达尼·维特找你 - "甚至系统也显示..."\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Danny Witwer's on the phone. - "It shows that even if the system..."
Dialogue: 1,1:49:59.62,1:50:01.37, ,,0,0,0,,- 他说有重要的事情 - "...我们不能过于依赖它"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He says it's important. - "...we are not."
Dialogue: 1,1:50:01.92,1:50:04.92, ,,0,0,0,,- "我提醒你预防犯罪..." - 拉马...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- "I remind you however, that the Precrime..." - Lamar...
Dialogue: 1,1:50:04.96,1:50:09.55, ,,0,0,0,,"...成功的阻止了成百上千宗谋杀"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"...still successfully intervene in hundreds of indented homicides."
Dialogue: 1,1:50:12.97,1:50:14.68, ,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 拉马 有事大不对劲儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- What? - Lamar there is something terrible wrong.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:15.18,1:50:16.85, ,,0,0,0,,- 我们跟错了人 - 什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- We're chasing the wrong man. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:16.89,1:50:17.93, ,,0,0,0,,我不想在电话上说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't wanna say it over the phone.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:19.06,1:50:20.44, ,,0,0,0,,在安德顿家见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Meet me at Andertons.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:21.19,1:50:23.31, ,,0,0,0,,我们在里奥·克罗的房间里发现了这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We recovered that from Leo Crow's hotel room.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:29.95,1:50:33.45, ,,0,0,0,,我记得我是什么时候把这个给他的 是在巴尔的摩市\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I remember when I gave this to him. Back in Baltimore.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:34.91,1:50:35.83, ,,0,0,0,,坐吧 先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Please, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:39.77,1:50:40.86, ,,0,0,0,,告诉我你的发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Tell me what you have.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:46.27,1:50:48.40, ,,0,0,0,,这是安妮·莱夫利凶杀案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is the murder of a woman named Anne Lively.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:51.28,1:50:52.86, ,,0,0,0,,约翰跟我说过这事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John told me about this.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:53.82,1:50:55.83, ,,0,0,0,,- 是系统告诉你的? - 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- You got this from Containment? - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:56.16,1:50:58.04, ,,0,0,0,,这个镜像来自双胞胎阿瑟和丹谢尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is from the twins, Arthur and Dashiell.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:58.24,1:50:59.50, ,,0,0,0,,阿加沙的镜像不见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Agatha's stream was missing.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:02.25,1:51:04.08, ,,0,0,0,,这个是从安德顿的朋友那得到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Now this one is from the cyberparlor.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:04.71,1:51:06.67, ,,0,0,0,,安德顿从阿加沙的大脑中下载的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anderton downloaded this directly from Agatha.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:07.34,1:51:08.92, ,,0,0,0,,由鲁福斯·威尼记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And Rufus Riley recorded it.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:12.47,1:51:15.85, ,,0,0,0,,- 是一样的预测 - 不全是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- It's the same prevision. - Not quite.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:18.31,1:51:19.68, ,,0,0,0,,看看水面的波纹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Look at the surface wind across the water.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:20.64,1:51:21.52, ,,0,0,0,,看那波纹..\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Watch the ripples...
Dialogue: 1,1:51:23.06,1:51:25.15, ,,0,0,0,,从岸边扩散开来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...moving away from shore.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:27.11,1:51:28.07, ,,0,0,0,,现在看第二个镜像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Now the second image.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:28.57,1:51:29.74, ,,0,0,0,,这是系统提供的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is the one from Containment.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:30.07,1:51:31.20, ,,0,0,0,,也就是阿瑟和丹谢尔看到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is what Art and Dash saw.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:32.41,1:51:33.03, ,,0,0,0,,看水面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Watch the water.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:35.53,1:51:36.41, ,,0,0,0,,风向变了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The wind's changed.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:37.87,1:51:39.20, ,,0,0,0,,波纹却改朝另一个方向扩散\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The ripples are moving the other way.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:42.00,1:51:43.83, ,,0,0,0,,这宗谋杀案是在两个不同的时间发生的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This murder is taking place at two different times.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:45.38,1:51:49.21, ,,0,0,0,,根据门卫所说 安德顿在他被通缉前看过这些镜像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}According to the Sentry, Anderton was watching this at Containment right before he was tagged.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:49.26,1:51:52.47, ,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道 他来拜访我 告诉我数据发生丢失\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What I know. He came to me, told me about the missing data stream.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:52.51,1:51:53.72, ,,0,0,0,,他担心你会发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He was concerned that you might find it.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:54.39,1:51:56.18, ,,0,0,0,,那他对了 我发现了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Well he was right. I did find it.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:56.47,1:51:57.97, ,,0,0,0,,这些镜像一直在阿加沙的脑子里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It was inside of Agatha the whole time.
Dialogue: 1,1:51:58.27,1:52:01.94, ,,0,0,0,,所以问题是 谁会想把这些从数据库里面删除呢?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So the question is, why would someone want this erased from the data file?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:03.52,1:52:06.90, ,,0,0,0,,丹尼 听着 告诉我你在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Danny, listen, tell me what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:08.24,1:52:12.32, ,,0,0,0,,- 我在想有人逃脱了罪责 - 怎么逃?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I'm thinking someone got away with murder. - How?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:13.37,1:52:17.04, ,,0,0,0,,杰德跟我说过 有时候预言师们 不止一次看到相同的谋杀?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Well Jad told me that sometimes the Precogs see the same murder more than once?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:17.54,1:52:18.58, ,,0,0,0,,这个叫镜像反射\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's called an echo.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:19.71,1:52:21.92, ,,0,0,0,,杰德管这个叫预言师幻觉记忆...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jad called it Precog deja vu...
Dialogue: 1,1:52:22.00,1:52:25.96, ,,0,0,0,,- 我们教技术员确定镜像的类型 避免错误... - 是啊 但是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Well we teach the tech's to identify them and disregard... - Yeah but...
Dialogue: 1,1:52:27.92,1:52:31.09, ,,0,0,0,,技术员怎么知道那仅仅是镜像反射?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What if the technician only thought he was looking at an echo?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:31.76,1:52:35.06, ,,0,0,0,,他怎么知道看到的仅仅是 完全不同谋杀案的合版?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What if what he was really looking at was a completely different murder all together?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:36.68,1:52:37.81, ,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:38.56,1:52:40.94, ,,0,0,0,,他所要做的就是雇人杀了安妮·莱夫利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All he would have to do is to hire someone to kill Anne Lively.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:40.98,1:52:44.31, ,,0,0,0,,雇那些流浪汉 瘾君子 那些一无所有的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Someone like a drifter, a neuroin addict, someone with nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:44.44,1:52:46.82, ,,0,0,0,,犯罪预警阻止凶案的发生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Precrime stops the murder from taking place.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:47.57,1:52:49.07, ,,0,0,0,,警察抓住凶手 带走他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Hails the killer, takes him away,
Dialogue: 1,1:52:49.49,1:52:51.11, ,,0,0,0,,但是就在那时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...but then, right then,
Dialogue: 1,1:52:51.61,1:52:54.66, ,,0,0,0,,另外一个人又重演了这个预言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...someone else has reviewed the Prevision.
Dialogue: 1,1:52:54.70,1:52:59.50, ,,0,0,0,,穿着同样的衣服 以完全相同的方式犯案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And dress in the same clothes commits a murder in exactly the same way.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:00.92,1:53:05.21, ,,0,0,0,,技术师看了看 以为是镜像反射 就把它删除了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Technician takes a look, think he's looking at an echo. Erases it.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:10.97,1:53:14.56, ,,0,0,0,,当然这仅限于有权使用犯罪预警的一把手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Of course it would have to be someone with access to the Previsions in the first place.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:15.35,1:53:20.98, ,,0,0,0,,- 一个处于高职位的人... - 嘘 你知道我听到什么了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Someone fairly high up... - Shhh. Do you know what I hear?
Dialogue: 1,1:53:23.77,1:53:24.48, ,,0,0,0,,什么也没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Nothing.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:25.82,1:53:27.11, ,,0,0,0,,没有上楼的脚步声\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No footsteps up the stairs.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:27.69,1:53:31.11, ,,0,0,0,,没有气垫船驶过窗外的声音 甚至连蜘蛛追踪器的嘀哒声都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}No hovercraft out the window and no clickity click of little spyders.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:31.37,1:53:33.24, ,,0,0,0,,你知道我为什么听不到那些声音吗 丹尼?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Do you know why I can't hear any of those things, Danny?
Dialogue: 1,1:53:33.28,1:53:36.37, ,,0,0,0,,因为现在 预言师预测不到这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Because right now, the Precogs can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:01.90,1:54:03.86, ,,0,0,0,,看到了吧 这很美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can you see? It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:05.57,1:54:08.11, ,,0,0,0,,- 我们去哪? - 安全的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Where are we going? - Some place safe.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:16.41,1:54:18.21, ,,0,0,0,,- 伯吉斯 - 拉马 我是劳拉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Burgess. - Lamar, it's Lara.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:18.50,1:54:20.58, ,,0,0,0,,- 是的 劳拉 - 你得帮他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Yes, Lara. - You have to help him.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:22.38,1:54:24.92, ,,0,0,0,,- 他来了? - 在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Is he there? - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:25.88,1:54:31.14, ,,0,0,0,,- 他和预言师在一起? - 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Has he got the Precog with him? - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:31.47,1:54:33.68, ,,0,0,0,,留住他们 我马上来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Keep them there. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:34.27,1:54:37.73, ,,0,0,0,,求求你 别跟丹尼说 我信不过他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Please, please, don't tell Danny Witwer. I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:39.06,1:54:40.31, ,,0,0,0,,我不会说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I won't say a word.
Dialogue: 1,1:54:42.15,1:54:46.19, ,,0,0,0,,别让约翰走了 好吧?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You just don't let John leave. All right?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:47.70,1:54:50.78, ,,0,0,0,,- 他不是杀手 拉马 - 我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He's no killer, Lamar. - I know.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:03.05,1:55:03.92, ,,0,0,0,,好冷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's cold.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:09.51,1:55:11.76, ,,0,0,0,,劳拉 这是阿加沙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lara. This is Agatha.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:17.73,1:55:18.35, ,,0,0,0,,还记得我...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Remember when I...
Dialogue: 1,1:55:19.15,1:55:22.32, ,,0,0,0,,...我读"汤姆·索尼亚历险记"给你和肖恩听吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...I would read Tom Sawyer to you and Sean?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:25.82,1:55:29.82, ,,0,0,0,,但读到汤姆和贝基在山洞里迷路了时 肖恩怕的不得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He got so scared, when Tom and Becky were lost in the cave.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:33.62,1:55:35.08, ,,0,0,0,,就像我一坐下...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's like I sit down...
Dialogue: 1,1:55:36.67,1:55:38.11, ,,0,0,0,,就能感觉到他的害怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Gotta figure this out.
Dialogue: 1,1:55:39.63,1:55:41.09, ,,0,0,0,,就能感觉到他的害怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Gotta figure this out.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:21.17,1:56:22.25, ,,0,0,0,,他们在利用肖恩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They used Sean.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:24.80,1:56:26.55, ,,0,0,0,,好让我以为是克罗杀了他..\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They wanted me to think Crow killed him...
Dialogue: 1,1:56:28.72,1:56:30.09, ,,0,0,0,,但是他没有杀他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But he didn't.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:31.93,1:56:33.21, ,,0,0,0,,他没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He didn't.
Dialogue: 1,1:56:35.27,1:56:36.90, ,,0,0,0,,他们为什么要陷害你?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Why would they set you up?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:45.24,1:56:47.20, ,,0,0,0,,因为我发现了关于她的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Because I found out about her...
Dialogue: 1,1:56:48.83,1:56:50.45, ,,0,0,0,,关于谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}About who?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:51.04,1:56:52.91, ,,0,0,0,,为什么我没想到这些?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How could I not have seen this?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:53.21,1:56:54.62, ,,0,0,0,,想到什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}See what?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:56.04,1:56:57.42, ,,0,0,0,,安妮·莱夫利...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anne Lively...
Dialogue: 1,1:57:00.67,1:57:01.38, ,,0,0,0,,阿加沙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Agatha.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:06.93,1:57:09.26, ,,0,0,0,,赫里曼博士曾经说:" 死人常在"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Dr. Hineman once said "The dead don't die."
Dialogue: 1,1:57:10.14,1:57:11.98, ,,0,0,0,,"他们看着我们 给我们帮助"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}"They look on and help."
Dialogue: 1,1:57:12.98,1:57:14.44, ,,0,0,0,,记住 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Remember that, John.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:16.35,1:57:18.81, ,,0,0,0,,- 阿加沙 - 肖恩...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Agatha. - Sean...
Dialogue: 1,1:57:23.45,1:57:24.82, ,,0,0,0,,他现在在沙滩上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's on the beach now.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:26.49,1:57:27.49, ,,0,0,0,,脚淌在水中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}A toe in the water.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:29.91,1:57:31.54, ,,0,0,0,,他要你和他在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's asking you to come in with him.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:33.54,1:57:36.08, ,,0,0,0,,他正和他的母亲在沙滩上打闹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's been racing his mother up and down the sand.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:38.71,1:57:40.50, ,,0,0,0,,这间房子里充满了如此多的爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There's so much love in this house.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:46.51,1:57:47.72, ,,0,0,0,,他10岁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's ten years old.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:50.68,1:57:52.31, ,,0,0,0,,他被动物包围着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's surrounded by animals.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:54.73,1:57:56.02, ,,0,0,0,,他想做个兽医\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He wants to be a vet.
Dialogue: 1,1:57:58.77,1:58:00.03, ,,0,0,0,,你给他养了一只兔子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You keep a rabbit for him.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:00.78,1:58:02.82, ,,0,0,0,,一只鸟 和一只狐狸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}A bird and a fox.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:05.03,1:58:06.16, ,,0,0,0,,他上高中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's in high school.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:07.41,1:58:10.12, ,,0,0,0,,他喜欢跑步 爱他的父亲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He likes to run. Like his father.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:10.70,1:58:13.12, ,,0,0,0,,他可以跑两英里而不用休息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He runs the two mile and the long relay.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:15.54,1:58:20.13, ,,0,0,0,,他23岁了 上了大学\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He's twenty-three, he's at a University.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:21.34,1:58:23.59, ,,0,0,0,,他和一个叫克莱尔的漂亮女孩恋爱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He makes love to a pretty girl named Claire.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:24.47,1:58:26.05, ,,0,0,0,,他向她求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He asks her to be his wife.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:27.56,1:58:30.31, ,,0,0,0,,他打电话来这里跟劳拉说谁在哭泣...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He calls here and tells Lara who cries...
Dialogue: 1,1:58:32.85,1:58:34.27, ,,0,0,0,,他仍然跑步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He still runs.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:35.36,1:58:38.44, ,,0,0,0,,穿过校园 跑在约翰可以看到他的运动场上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Across the University and in the stadium where John watches.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:39.57,1:58:42.99, ,,0,0,0,,噢 天...他跑得如此之快 就像他的爸爸一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Oh, God...he's running so fast just like his daddy.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:44.74,1:58:45.78, ,,0,0,0,,他看见了他的爸爸 ...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He sees his daddy...
Dialogue: 1,1:58:46.66,1:58:50.04, ,,0,0,0,,他想跑过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...he wants to run to him...
Dialogue: 1,1:58:50.37,1:58:54.42, ,,0,0,0,,但他只有6岁 他还办不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}..but he's only six years old and he can't do it.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:55.17,1:58:57.09, ,,0,0,0,,而那个人却是如此之快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And the other man is so fast.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:01.76,1:59:03.72, ,,0,0,0,,这间房子里充满了爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There was so much love in this house.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:05.64,1:59:07.39, ,,0,0,0,,我是如此的想他回来...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I want him back so bad...
Dialogue: 1,1:59:10.52,1:59:11.94, ,,0,0,0,,她也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So did she.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:13.06,1:59:13.98, ,,0,0,0,,难道你感觉不到吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Can't you see?
Dialogue: 1,1:59:18.53,1:59:20.28, ,,0,0,0,,她只是想让她的宝贝回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She just wanted her little girl back.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:23.95,1:59:25.41, ,,0,0,0,,但是太晚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But it was too late.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:27.91,1:59:29.83, ,,0,0,0,,那个小女孩已经不存在了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The little girl was already gone.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:31.00,1:59:32.62, ,,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She's still alive.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:34.33,1:59:35.42, ,,0,0,0,,她没有死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She didn't die.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:36.63,1:59:38.13, ,,0,0,0,,但她也没有活着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But she's not alive.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:40.30,1:59:41.34, ,,0,0,0,,阿加沙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Agatha.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:44.43,1:59:45.51, ,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just tell me.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:46.39,1:59:48.22, ,,0,0,0,,谁杀了你妈妈?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Who killed your mother?
Dialogue: 1,1:59:49.23,1:59:50.52, ,,0,0,0,,谁杀了安妮·莱夫利?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Who killed Anne Lively?
Dialogue: 1,1:59:52.40,1:59:57.86, ,,0,0,0,,对不起 约翰 但是你必须再次逃跑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm sorry, John, but you gonna have to run again.
Dialogue: 1,1:59:58.74,2:00:01.53, ,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 快跑!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- What...? - RUN!
Dialogue: 1,2:00:17.67,2:00:18.80, ,,0,0,0,,我爱你!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I love you!
Dialogue: 1,2:00:20.01,2:00:23.89, ,,0,0,0,,来吧 没事的 没关系 你会没事的 安德顿太太\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Come on. It's okay. It's okay. You'll be fine Mrs. Anderton.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:24.14,2:00:26.39, ,,0,0,0,,- 不! - 和我在一起好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- No! - Stay with me. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:46.16,2:00:47.04, ,,0,0,0,,约翰·安德顿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John Anderton.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:48.91,2:00:51.58, ,,0,0,0,,遵照哥伦比亚特区犯罪预防部的命令\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}By mandate of the District of Columbia, Precrime division..
Dialogue: 1,2:00:52.21,2:00:56.30, ,,0,0,0,,我以杀害里奥·克罗和 丹尼·维特沃的名义拘捕你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm placing you under arrest for the murders of Leo Crow and Danny Witwer...
Dialogue: 1,2:01:00.38,2:01:03.72, ,,0,0,0,,这才对... 这才是我的乖女孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That's it... that's my girl...
Dialogue: 1,2:01:06.27,2:01:07.47, ,,0,0,0,,我好担心你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I were so worried about you.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:12.36,2:01:13.40, ,,0,0,0,,他有没有伤害你?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Did he hurt you?
Dialogue: 1,2:01:17.40,2:01:18.95, ,,0,0,0,,天那 我真想你...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}God, I missed you so much...
Dialogue: 1,2:01:19.15,2:01:20.95, ,,0,0,0,,没关系了 威尼在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's okay. Wally is here.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:21.91,2:01:23.03, ,,0,0,0,,威尼在这...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Wally is here...
Dialogue: 1,2:01:28.62,2:01:33.00, ,,0,0,0,,你现在由我处置了 约翰 欢迎光临\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're part of my flock now, John. Welcome.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:34.88,2:01:36.84, ,,0,0,0,,这真是个大反差\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's actually kind of a rush.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:37.34,2:01:42.30, ,,0,0,0,,他们说你有妄想 说你的生命在你眼中闪烁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}They say you have visions, that your life flashes before your eyes.
Dialogue: 1,2:01:42.47,2:01:45.51, ,,0,0,0,,他们说你的梦想将会成真\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That all your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:02.78,2:02:04.41, ,,0,0,0,,这都是我的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:06.20,2:02:07.87, ,,0,0,0,,在这件事上 任何人都无能为力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}There was nothing anyone could do.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:13.30,2:02:14.92, ,,0,0,0,,我猜你可能需要这些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I thought you might want to have those.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:22.35,2:02:25.93, ,,0,0,0,,我好多年没穿这个了 我想确定今晚穿是否还合身\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I haven't worn this in years. I just wanted to make sure it fits before tonight.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:26.60,2:02:27.85, ,,0,0,0,,你看上去很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You look great.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:28.48,2:02:32.69, ,,0,0,0,,我知道他曾经有过麻烦 但是我却什么都帮不上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I knew he was having trouble for some time, and yet I did nothing about it.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:32.73,2:02:35.19, ,,0,0,0,,打扰一下 今日美国的记者来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Excuse me. The guy from USA Today is here.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:35.36,2:02:36.49, ,,0,0,0,,告诉他现在不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Tell him not now.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:36.53,2:02:39.24, ,,0,0,0,,- 他只需要几分钟时间... - 现在不行!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- He just wanted a few minutes before... - Not now!
Dialogue: 1,2:02:42.45,2:02:44.37, ,,0,0,0,,我以为你已经退休了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I thought you were retiring?
Dialogue: 1,2:02:44.41,2:02:45.62, ,,0,0,0,,是啊 的确是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Well I was.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:46.29,2:02:51.17, ,,0,0,0,,但是约翰的意外让我认识到整个制度的脆弱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But this incident with John made me realize the fragility of all this.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:52.71,2:02:55.51, ,,0,0,0,,这是约翰留给我的启示\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}This is John's legacy as much as it is my own.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:56.76,2:03:00.26, ,,0,0,0,,现在我有义务保全它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Now I have an obligation to protect that.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:00.72,2:03:01.51, ,,0,0,0,,劳拉...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lara...
Dialogue: 1,2:03:02.76,2:03:05.06, ,,0,0,0,,我知道这对你来说很困难 但是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I know how difficult this is for you. But...
Dialogue: 1,2:03:05.98,2:03:08.90, ,,0,0,0,,也许你可以给这件事划上句号...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Maybe you can find some closure in the fact that...
Dialogue: 1,2:03:09.19,2:03:11.65, ,,0,0,0,,但事实上约翰发现了杀你儿子的凶手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...John finally found the man who killed your son.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:15.53,2:03:16.74, ,,0,0,0,,安妮·莱夫利是谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Who's Anne Lively?
Dialogue: 1,2:03:19.49,2:03:20.45, ,,0,0,0,,谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Who?
Dialogue: 1,2:03:20.99,2:03:25.62, ,,0,0,0,,安妮·莱夫利 在被抓之前约翰正提到她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anne Lively. John was talking about her right before they took him.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:26.37,2:03:27.62, ,,0,0,0,,我不知道她是谁?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:30.00,2:03:33.96, ,,0,0,0,,约翰说他被陷害是因为 他发现了一些关于她的线索\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}John said something about him being set up because he "found out about her."
Dialogue: 1,2:03:35.30,2:03:36.97, ,,0,0,0,,我们都知道约翰为什么被捕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We know why John was tagged.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:37.76,2:03:39.47, ,,0,0,0,,他还说克罗只是一个假象\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}He also said Crow was a fake.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:40.35,2:03:43.97, ,,0,0,0,,维特沃呢? 他是在约翰的办公室里被约翰的枪打死的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And Witwer? He was killed with John's gun inside John's apartment...
Dialogue: 1,2:03:44.02,2:03:44.47, ,,0,0,0,,拉马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lamar.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:44.81,2:03:48.23, ,,0,0,0,,你知道约翰为什么来此为你工作?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Do you know the reason why John came here to work for you?
Dialogue: 1,2:03:49.27,2:03:53.53, ,,0,0,0,,- 为了肖恩? - 是的 他来为你效力...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Sean...? - Yes. He came here to work for you..
Dialogue: 1,2:03:53.82,2:03:56.20, ,,0,0,0,,因为他觉得如果他那样做...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}..because he thought if he could just...
Dialogue: 1,2:03:57.24,2:03:59.62, ,,0,0,0,,就可以阻止这样的悲剧发生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...stop that kind of thing from happening.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:00.53,2:04:03.04, ,,0,0,0,,- 我理解 - 不 我不认为你理解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- I understand. - No. I don't think you do.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:03.79,2:04:07.71, ,,0,0,0,,先生 他们希望记者招待会 在两分钟内开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sir, they wanna start the press conference in two minutes.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:08.67,2:04:12.32, ,,0,0,0,,劳拉 约翰是我见过的最好的警察\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lara, John was the best cop I ever knew,
Dialogue: 1,2:04:12.40,2:04:14.72, ,,0,0,0,,或者某种意义上 也是我见过最好的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}and in some ways also the best man.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:16.34,2:04:19.68, ,,0,0,0,,但是他的灵魂被伤痛所扭曲 呃...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But the scars he carried around, well...
Dialogue: 1,2:04:20.47,2:04:23.81, ,,0,0,0,,我知道他希望我们赞扬他的英雄事迹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I know that he's want us to honor the good things we remember about him.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:25.23,2:04:26.98, ,,0,0,0,,我也知道为何他会娶你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I also know why he married you:
Dialogue: 1,2:04:27.60,2:04:29.48, ,,0,0,0,,你和他一样顽固\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're as stubborn as he is.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:30.44,2:04:31.40, ,,0,0,0,,拉马...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lamar...
Dialogue: 1,2:04:31.44,2:04:34.78, ,,0,0,0,,劳拉...你知道怎么系这个领结吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lara...do you how ton tie one of these?
Dialogue: 1,2:04:35.03,2:04:38.20, ,,0,0,0,,你能帮我一下吗? 你知道我总是很笨拙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Could you please give me a hand? I'm all thumbs you see.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:47.25,2:04:49.96, ,,0,0,0,,听着 我会告诉你我的计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Listen. I'll tell you what I'll do.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:50.25,2:04:53.34, ,,0,0,0,,首先 星期一 我将调查维特沃的证据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}First thing Monday, I'll look over the Witwer evidence.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:54.68,2:04:58.20, ,,0,0,0,,而且 我会让基德查一下系统记录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And I'll have Gideon run the Containment files,
Dialogue: 1,2:04:58.30,2:05:00.81, ,,0,0,0,,看看是否有一个溺毙的女人叫...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}see if anyone drowned a woman by the name of...
Dialogue: 1,2:05:01.68,2:05:03.64, ,,0,0,0,,你说她叫什么来着?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What did you say her name was?
Dialogue: 1,2:05:06.56,2:05:07.73, ,,0,0,0,,安妮·莱夫利...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anne Lively...
Dialogue: 1,2:05:08.90,2:05:10.40, ,,0,0,0,,但我从来没说过她是淹死的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But I never said she drowned.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:31.30,2:05:35.05, ,,0,0,0,,- 先生 招待会开始了 - 我马上就来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Sir, the press conference is starting. - I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:40.43,2:05:42.48, ,,0,0,0,,我们稍后再谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We'll talk about this later.
Dialogue: 1,2:05:44.02,2:05:47.94, ,,0,0,0,,或许明天? 我会去乡村别墅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Perhaps tomorrow? I'll come by the cottage.
Dialogue: 1,2:06:25.27,2:06:26.94, ,,0,0,0,,我想和我丈夫说几句话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'd like a word with my husband.
Dialogue: 1,2:06:28.61,2:06:33.49, ,,0,0,0,,你未被授权 是怎么进来的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You are not authorized. How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 1,2:06:44.83,2:06:46.30, ,,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 这位是拉马·伯吉斯先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Ladies and gentlemen, Lamar Burgess,
Dialogue: 1,2:06:46.33,2:06:49.30, ,,0,0,0,,新的国家犯罪预防部主任\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10} Director of the new, national Precrime.
Dialogue: 1,2:06:51.88,2:06:57.93, ,,0,0,0,,我代表全体职员 很荣幸的把这个献上 祝贺你 先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}On behalf of your staff, we would like you to present you with this. Congratulations, Sir.
Dialogue: 1,2:06:58.35,2:06:59.77, ,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}My God...
Dialogue: 1,2:07:01.73,2:07:02.73, ,,0,0,0,,你们怎么弄到这个的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How did you get this?
Dialogue: 1,2:07:03.02,2:07:05.27, ,,0,0,0,,我报销了您六个月的帐单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I padded your expense account for six months.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:08.94,2:07:10.44, ,,0,0,0,,这把左轮手枪...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Revolvers like this one...
Dialogue: 1,2:07:11.03,2:07:15.03, ,,0,0,0,,是在南北战争末期 士兵献给他们的将军的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...were given to Generals at the end of the Civil War by their troops.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:16.28,2:07:19.87, ,,0,0,0,,弹夹里面有五颗镀金子弹...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The cylinders were loaded with five gold-plated bullets..
Dialogue: 1,2:07:20.29,2:07:25.34, ,,0,0,0,,象征着国家分裂五年引起的破坏和死亡的结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...to symbolize the end of the destruction and death that had ripped the country apart for five years.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:26.29,2:07:27.21, ,,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:27.84,2:07:29.38, ,,0,0,0,,随着犯罪预警的全国性普及...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}With Precrime going national...
Dialogue: 1,2:07:30.22,2:07:33.55, ,,0,0,0,,也许我们就能期盼一个...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...maybe we can all look forward to a time when none of us...
Dialogue: 1,2:07:34.01,2:07:37.10, ,,0,0,0,,一个没有枪炮暴力时代的来临\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...will have to discharge another firearm ever again.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:39.60,2:07:42.64, ,,0,0,0,,好好享受吧 这是命令!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Enjoy yourself. Enjoy yourself! That's an order!
Dialogue: 1,2:07:46.86,2:07:49.69, ,,0,0,0,,这是否意味着我们可以 在周末享受湖边小屋的浪漫了?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Does this mean we can finally use the lake house on weekends?
Dialogue: 1,2:07:53.66,2:07:54.57, ,,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Hello?
Dialogue: 1,2:07:55.08,2:07:56.74, ,,0,0,0,,是的 稍等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yes. Right away.
Dialogue: 1,2:07:58.00,2:07:58.79, ,,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:01.37,2:08:03.12, ,,0,0,0,,- 先生... - 有事吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Sir... - Yes?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:03.17,2:08:05.25, ,,0,0,0,,先生 有专线紧急电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sir, you have an emergency call on your private line.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:07.46,2:08:10.72, ,,0,0,0,,- 喂 我是伯吉斯 - 喂 拉马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- Yes. This is Burgess. - Hello, Lamar.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:10.76,2:08:13.01, ,,0,0,0,,我只是想祝贺你 你成功了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I just wanted to congratulate you. You did it.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:14.30,2:08:16.85, ,,0,0,0,,你创造了一个没有谋杀的世界\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You're created a world without murder.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:17.06,2:08:19.77, ,,0,0,0,,先生 每个人都希望您在他们的帽子上签名 您能给我们签几个吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Sir. Everyone wants your name on a hat, can you sign these for us?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:20.31,2:08:22.98, ,,0,0,0,,你能做的就是杀掉一些人来达到你的目的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And all you had to do is to kill someone to do it.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:27.53,2:08:28.44, ,,0,0,0,,这里是A区 我是杰德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}A-room. Jad.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:29.53,2:08:32.82, ,,0,0,0,,杰德 我是劳拉 约翰需要帮助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jad. It's Lara. John needs a favour...
Dialogue: 1,2:08:33.07,2:08:34.20, ,,0,0,0,,我不明白你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:34.24,2:08:37.79, ,,0,0,0,,我在说阿加沙的妈妈 安妮·莱夫利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}I'm talking about Agatha's mother, Anne Lively.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:37.95,2:08:40.08, ,,0,0,0,,一个吸毒者 曾经有一个小孩但不得不丢弃她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Just a junkie who had a kid once and had to give her up.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:40.12,2:08:43.13, ,,0,0,0,,但...奇怪的是 她戒毒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}But...surprise. She cleaned herself up.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:43.25,2:08:44.67, ,,0,0,0,,她想找回她的女儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And she wanted her daughter back.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:45.05,2:08:46.25, ,,0,0,0,,她想要回阿加沙...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She wanted Agatha...
Dialogue: 1,2:08:50.13,2:08:51.09, ,,0,0,0,,杰德? 你看到了吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jad? You getting this?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:51.43,2:08:54.22, ,,0,0,0,,这是一个单独的镜像 只有阿加沙有 没有时间和事件的数据\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's a single stream, from the female only, with no time or incident data.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:54.26,2:08:56.68, ,,0,0,0,,不管是什么 这不代表将来 它已经发生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Whatever this is, it isn't the future. It already happened.
Dialogue: 1,2:08:57.06,2:09:00.44, ,,0,0,0,,但是问题是 离开阿加沙 就不会有犯罪预言了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And the problem was without Agatha, there was no Precrime.
Dialogue: 1,2:09:00.73,2:09:03.31, ,,0,0,0,,她总是三个中能力最强的一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}She's always been the strongest of the three.
Dialogue: 1,2:09:03.31,2:09:05.48, ,,0,0,0,,你知道如果没有了阿加沙 一切都完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You knew without Agatha,you had nothing.
Dialogue: 1,2:09:05.65,2:09:10.20, ,,0,0,0,,没有了她 你就不会有现在的辉煌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Without her, you wouldn't be where you are now, standing there signing autographs...
Dialogue: 1,2:09:19.33,2:09:20.12, ,,0,0,0,,杰德 你在干什么?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jad, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,2:09:21.29,2:09:22.88, ,,0,0,0,,杰德 你要拿它怎么样?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jad, what are you doing with that?
Dialogue: 1,2:09:22.92,2:09:26.38, ,,0,0,0,,杰德 发送之前最好先考虑清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Jad, let's think before you send that.
Dialogue: 1,2:09:48.45,2:09:51.28, ,,0,0,0,,现在你得摆脱安妮·莱夫利 最好让她闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So now you had to get rid of Anne Lively, you had to shut her up.
Dialogue: 1,2:09:51.57,2:09:52.74, ,,0,0,0,,因为她揭示了一个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Which presented a problem.
Dialogue: 1,2:09:53.16,2:09:56.41, ,,0,0,0,,你如何杀了她而又避免被预言师们预测到的?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}How can you kill her without the Precogs seeing it?
Dialogue: 1,2:09:56.87,2:10:01.04, ,,0,0,0,,很简单:利用你控制的系统对付她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Simple: use the system you control against her.
Dialogue: 1,2:10:01.42,2:10:06.26, ,,0,0,0,,在知道预言师会预见到这次谋杀的前提下 你雇佣了别人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So you hired someone to kill her for you, knowing full well the Precogs would see that murder.
Dialogue: 1,2:10:06.72,2:10:09.68, ,,0,0,0,,你假装答应要让她们母子重逢...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You lured Anne Lively out to the lake...
Dialogue: 1,2:10:10.43,2:10:13.35, ,,0,0,0,,借此把她骗到湖边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...with the promise of reuniting her with her daughter...
Dialogue: 1,2:11:11.45,2:11:12.74, ,,0,0,0,,快跑...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Run!
Dialogue: 1,2:11:15.50,2:11:17.29, ,,0,0,0,,快跑!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Run!
Dialogue: 1,2:11:29.26,2:11:32.31, ,,0,0,0,,然后 当你们单独在一起的时候... 你亲手杀了她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}And then, when you were all alone... you killed her yourself.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:32.47,2:11:36.10, ,,0,0,0,,就和预言师看到无名氏杀她的方式一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In the same way the Precogs predicted your John Doe would kill her.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:36.39,2:11:38.98, ,,0,0,0,,你制造了这起看上去就像一个镜像反射的谋杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You made the real murder look like an echo...
Dialogue: 1,2:11:39.27,2:11:43.28, ,,0,0,0,,你知道技术师们都会按照 他们的培训课程讲的那样 忽略它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...knowing the tech would do what he was trained to do. Disregard it.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:50.16,2:11:53.83, ,,0,0,0,,安妮·莱夫利就成了另一个失踪的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Anne Lively became just another missing person.
Dialogue: 1,2:11:55.58,2:11:57.87, ,,0,0,0,,那么 你要怎么办 拉马?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So. What are you gonna do, Lamar?
Dialogue: 1,2:11:59.08,2:12:00.00, ,,0,0,0,,你该怎么办?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,2:12:12.47,2:12:13.64, ,,0,0,0,,我们有一个红球事件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}We got a Red Ball!
Dialogue: 1,2:12:20.02,2:12:22.19, ,,0,0,0,,想想那个女孩所救的人命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Think about the lives that little girl has saved.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:23.07,2:12:24.94, ,,0,0,0,,想想那个女孩所救的人命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Think about the lives that little girl has saved.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:25.40,2:12:27.03, ,,0,0,0,,想想她还会救多少人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Think about all the lives she will save.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:27.57,2:12:30.41, ,,0,0,0,,那个小女孩本来能救肖恩一命的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That little girl could have saved Sean...
Dialogue: 1,2:12:30.91,2:12:33.29, ,,0,0,0,,别跟我提起这个名字!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}DON'T YOU EVER SAY HIS NAME!
Dialogue: 1,2:12:35.50,2:12:38.71, ,,0,0,0,,你利用我对我儿子的记忆来陷害我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You used the memory of my dead son to set me up.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:38.84,2:12:41.75, ,,0,0,0,,你利用我对我儿子的记忆来陷害我!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You used the memory of my dead son to set me up.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:41.92,2:12:44.97, ,,0,0,0,,你知道那是唯一可以让我变成杀人犯的理由\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}That was the one thing you knew that would drive me to murder.
Dialogue: 1,2:12:45.26,2:12:47.01, ,,0,0,0,,你要干什么 拉马?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What are you going to do now, Lamar?
Dialogue: 1,2:12:47.26,2:12:48.55, ,,0,0,0,,你现在要干什么 拉马?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What are you going to do now, Lamar?
Dialogue: 1,2:12:48.80,2:12:50.43, ,,0,0,0,,- 你想怎么样...? - 让我闭嘴?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- How are you gonna... - Shut me up?
Dialogue: 1,2:12:50.93,2:12:52.10, ,,0,0,0,,原谅我 约翰!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Forgive me, John!
Dialogue: 1,2:13:01.61,2:13:02.61, ,,0,0,0,,原谅我 约翰!\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Forgive me, John!
Dialogue: 1,2:13:15.12,2:13:15.58, ,,0,0,0,,拉马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Lamar.
Dialogue: 1,2:13:16.75,2:13:17.38, ,,0,0,0,,都结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}It's over.
Dialogue: 1,2:13:18.71,2:13:20.88, ,,0,0,0,,你要问的问题是:\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The question you have to ask is:
Dialogue: 1,2:13:21.42,2:13:23.51, ,,0,0,0,,你现在要怎么办?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What are you gonna do now?
Dialogue: 1,2:13:37.44,2:13:41.03, ,,0,0,0,,- 勿庸置疑预言师已经预测到这一切了 - 是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}- No doubt the Precogs have already seen this. - No doubt.
Dialogue: 1,2:13:43.36,2:13:44.74, ,,0,0,0,,你现在进退两难了 不是吗?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You see the dilemma,don't you?
Dialogue: 1,2:13:46.24,2:13:49.95, ,,0,0,0,,如果你不杀我 那么预言师就错了 预警系统就完蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you don't kill me, the Precogs were wrong and Precrime is over.
Dialogue: 1,2:13:51.62,2:13:57.42, ,,0,0,0,,如果你杀了我 你就完了 但是证明系统是有效的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}If you do kill me, you go away, but it proves the system works.
Dialogue: 1,2:13:58.09,2:13:59.30, ,,0,0,0,,预言师是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}The Precogs were right.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:06.26,2:14:08.60, ,,0,0,0,,那你现在该怎么做?\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}So what are you gonna do now?
Dialogue: 1,2:14:11.18,2:14:15.06, ,,0,0,0,,有什么价值吗? 仅仅是多了一宗凶杀案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}What's it worth? Just one more murder...
Dialogue: 1,2:14:19.15,2:14:22.32, ,,0,0,0,,你将会带着光环下地狱 而人们仍然相信犯罪预警系统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You'll rot in hell with a halo, but people will still believe in Precrime.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:23.70,2:14:26.95, ,,0,0,0,,你现在所要做的就是 像他们预见的那样杀了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All you have to do now is kill me like they said you would.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:31.50,2:14:32.58, ,,0,0,0,,除了...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Except...
Dialogue: 1,2:14:33.96,2:14:35.79, ,,0,0,0,,你知道你自己的未来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You know your own future.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:36.71,2:14:39.67, ,,0,0,0,,这意味着如果你想 你就可以改变它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Which means you can change it if you want to.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:41.26,2:14:43.38, ,,0,0,0,,你仍然有得选择 拉马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}You still have a choice, Lamar.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:44.80,2:14:45.80, ,,0,0,0,,就像我一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Like I did.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:51.35,2:14:53.44, ,,0,0,0,,是的 我还有选择...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Yes, I have a choice...
Dialogue: 1,2:14:55.44,2:14:56.44, ,,0,0,0,,而且我也会那样做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}...and I've made it.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:58.32,2:14:59.36, ,,0,0,0,,原谅我 约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Forgive me, John.
Dialogue: 1,2:15:01.95,2:15:03.07, ,,0,0,0,,原谅我...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Forgive me...
Dialogue: 1,2:15:09.12,2:15:10.58, ,,0,0,0,,原谅我 我的孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Forgive me, my boy.
Dialogue: 1,2:15:42.11,2:15:46.37, ,,0,0,0,,在2054年 也就是犯罪预警计划实施的第六年 预警系统被取消了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In 2054 the six year Precrime experiment was abandoned.
Dialogue: 1,2:15:54.54,2:15:57.34, ,,0,0,0,,所有的犯人都被无条件赦免和释放\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}All prisoners were unconditionally pardoned and released.
Dialogue: 1,2:15:57.80,2:16:01.51, ,,0,0,0,,但是警察仍然在接下来的几年里 对大部分人实施了监控\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Although police departments kept watch on many of them for years to come.
Dialogue: 1,2:16:50.14,2:16:52.19, ,,0,0,0,,阿加沙和那对双胞胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Agatha and the twins.
Dialogue: 1,2:16:52.75,2:16:54.90, ,,0,0,0,,被送至一处秘密地点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}Were transferred to an undisclosed location.
Dialogue: 1,2:16:57.19,2:16:59.11, ,,0,0,0,,一个可以让他们放松的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}A place where they could find relief from there gifts.
Dialogue: 1,2:17:00.70,2:17:02.41, ,,0,0,0,,一个可以让他们...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}A place where they could live out their lives.
Dialogue: 1,2:17:02.70,2:17:04.03, ,,0,0,0,,平静生活的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs10}In peace.
